ny time.'=>'Reassign the correct language-specific template to every existing translation of this post. No AI call and no content changes — free and safe to run any time.','Template Sync — reassign templates for every translation'=>'Template Sync — reassign templates for every translation','TS'=>'TS','Last rule-based SEO score. Run analysis in Settings → SEO → Analysis to update.'=>'Last rule-based SEO score. Run analysis in Settings → SEO → Analysis to update.','Translating…'=>'Translating…','Retranslating…'=>'Retranslating…','Syncing…'=>'Syncing…','This retranslates every other language version of this post from this one — creating any that are missing and overwriting any that already exist (including the primary language, if this post is a translation). This cannot be undone. Continue?'=>'This retranslates every other language version of this post from this one — creating any that are missing and overwriting any that already exist (including the primary language, if this post is a translation). This cannot be undone. Continue?','Syncing templates…'=>'Syncing templates…','✓ Done'=>'✓ Done','Error'=>'Error','Navigation posts are translated via the Router tab, not this button.'=>'Navigation posts are translated via the Router tab, not this button.','Creating translations for post type "%s" requires an active integration. Please ensure the required integration is installed and active.'=>'Creating translations for post type "%s" requires an active integration. Please ensure the required integration is installed and active.','No %s version found in this translation group.'=>'No %s version found in this translation group.','Sync from a secondary-language WooCommerce product is disabled by default, since it would overwrite the primary product. Enable it in Settings → Behavior → WooCommerce if you want a translation to be able to become the new source content.'=>'Sync from a secondary-language WooCommerce product is disabled by default, since it would overwrite the primary product. Enable it in Settings → Behavior → WooCommerce if you want a translation to be able to become the new source content.','Sync from a secondary-language post is disabled by default, since it would overwrite the primary post. Enable it in Settings → Behavior → Sync if you want a translation to be able to become the new source content.'=>'Sync from a secondary-language post is disabled by default, since it would overwrite the primary post. Enable it in Settings → Behavior → Sync if you want a translation to be able to become the new source content.','Skipped — you do not have permission to edit the existing translation.'=>'Skipped — you do not have permission to edit the existing translation.','Creating translations for post type "%s" requires an active integration.'=>'Creating translations for post type "%s" requires an active integration.','Template Sync can only be run from the primary/source-language post.'=>'Template Sync can only be run from the primary/source-language post.','Skipped — you do not have permission to edit this translation.'=>'Skipped — you do not have permission to edit this translation.','Translation Caching'=>'Translation Caching','Lingua Forge uses two independent caching layers to avoid redundant AI API calls. Use the tabs below to inspect and manage each one.'=>'Lingua Forge uses two independent caching layers to avoid redundant AI API calls. Use the tabs below to inspect and manage each one.','API Response Cache'=>'API Response Cache','Translation Memory'=>'Translation Memory','(disabled)'=>'(disabled)','Per-post cache for AI-generated translations, meta descriptions, excerpts, and content. Entries are invalidated automatically when the content or AI provider/model changes.'=>'Per-post cache for AI-generated translations, meta descriptions, excerpts, and content. Entries are invalidated automatically when the content or AI provider/model changes.','Enable API response caching'=>'Enable API response caching','The API Response Cache 