ual SEO layer (hreflang, og:locale, inLanguage schema) that requires knowledge of LF\'s language routing configuration to produce correctly.','Installed SEO plugins'=>'Installed SEO plugins','Plugin'=>'Plugin','Status'=>'Status','✓ Active'=>'✓ Active','— Not detected'=>'— Not detected','No conflicting SEO plugins detected. Lingua Forge is handling all SEO output independently.'=>'No conflicting SEO plugins detected. Lingua Forge manages all SEO output independently.','What LF provides — and collision avoidance'=>'What LF provides — and collision avoidance','Feature'=>'Feature','LF provides'=>'LF offers','When another SEO plugin is installed'=>'When another SEO plugin is installed','Hreflang'=>'Hreflang','Disabled (by setting)'=>'Disabled (by setting)','✓ LF outputs — plugin hreflang suppressed'=>'✓ LF outputs — plugin hreflang suppressed','✓ LF outputs'=>'✓ LF outputs','LF outputs accurate hreflang for every configured language, including x-default. General SEO plugins have no access to your LF routing configuration and would produce hreflang based on incorrect URL assumptions. LF suppresses their output via filter to prevent collisions.'=>'LF provides precise hreflang tags for every configured language, including x-default. Typical SEO plugins do not access your LF routing setup and might generate hreflang tags based on incorrect URL assumptions. LF suppresses their output through filters to avoid conflicts.','Suppressed: %s.'=>'Suppressed: %s.','Open Graph'=>'Open Graph','Disabled (mode setting)'=>'Disabled (mode setting)','→ Locale tags only — deferring base OG to plugin'=>'→ Locale tags only — deferring base OG to plugin','→ Locale tags only (manual setting)'=>'→ Locale tags only (manual setting)','✓ LF outputs full OG + Twitter Cards'=>'✓ LF outputs full OG + Twitter Cards','LF always adds og:locale and og:locale:alternate — the multilingual OG signals no general SEO plugin can produce correctly. For the base OG set (og:title, og:description, og:image), LF outputs it when no other plugin is present. When a SEO plugin is installed, LF skips the base set to avoid duplicate tags — not because the plugin is "better", but because duplication produces no value.'=>'LF always adds og:locale and og:locale:alternate — the multilingual OG signals no general SEO plugin can produce correctly. For the base OG set (og:title, og:description, og:image), LF outputs it when no other plugin is present. When a SEO plugin is installed, LF skips the base set to avoid duplicate tags — not because the plugin is "better", but because duplication produces no value.','Schema.org JSON-LD'=>'Schema.org JSON-LD','— Deferred to plugin'=>'— Deferred to plugin','✓ LF outputs Article / WebPage / WebSite'=>'✓ LF outputs Article / WebPage / WebSite','LF outputs multilingual JSON-LD with inLanguage annotations tied to its language routing configuration. When a SEO plugin is installed, LF disables its own schema entirely: duplicate JSON-LD graphs produce validation errors and there is no clean way to supplement an existing graph.'=>'LF generates multilingual JSON-LD with inLanguage annotations linked to its language routing setup. When an SEO plugin is active, LF disables its own schema entirely: duplicate JSON-LD graphs can cause validation errors, and there is no straightforward way to add to an existing graph.','XML Sitemap'=>'XML Sitemap','✓ Active at /lf-sitemap.xml'=>'✓ Active at /lf-sitemap.xml','LF generates its own sitemap with xhtml:link alternates for all translation groups. When a SEO plugin is installed, it generates a separate sitemap — both coexist independently. Submit both to Google Search Console: the SEO plugin sitemap for content discovery, the LF sitemap for language relationship signals.'=>'LF generates its own sitemap with xhtml:link alternates for all translation groups. When a SEO plugin is installed, it generates a separate sitemap — both coexist independently. Submit both to Google Search Console: the SEO plugin sitemap for content discovery, the LF sitemap for language relationship signals.','Canonical tag'=>'Canonical tag','✓ WP canonical replaced (self-referencing)'=>'✓ WP canonical replaced (self-referencing)','WP core canonical active (hreflang disabled)'=>'WP core canonical active (hreflang disabled)','LF removes the WordPress core canonical tag and replaces it with a self-referencing canonical pointing to the correct language-prefixed URL. When a third-party SEO plugin (Yoast, Rank Math, AIOSEO, SEOPress) is active, LF defers canonical management to that plugin entirely.'=>'LF removes the WordPress core canonical tag and replaces it with a self-referencing canonical pointing to the correct language-prefixed URL. When a third-party SEO plugin (Yoast, Rank Math, AIOSEO, SEOPress) is active, LF defers canonical management to that plugin entirely.','Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin'=>'Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin','The lf-social-share mu-plugin is active.'=>'The lf-social-share mu-plugin is active.','Lingua Forge\'s built-in Social Share and Open Graph modules cover all functionality the mu-plugin provides, plus multilingual og:locale support. You can safely deactivate the mu-plugin.'=>'Lingua Forge\'s built-in Social Share and Open Graph modules cover all features the mu-plugin offers, plus multilingual og:locale support. You can safely deactivate the mu-plugin.','OG/Twitter Card tags: handled by LF\'s Open Graph module (SEO → Open Graph & Twitter Cards)'=>'OG/Twitter Card tags: handled by LF\'s Open Graph module (SEO → Open Graph & Twitter Cards)','Social Icons block share: URLs: handled by LF\'s built-in Social Share (SEO → Social Share)'=>'Social Icons block share: URLs: handled by LF\'s built-in Social Share (SEO → Social Share)','copy/native/auto JS actions: handled by LF\'s social-share.js'=>'copy/native/auto JS actions: handled by LF\'s social-share.js','While active, the mu-plugin handles the base OG set and LF emits locale tags only (auto mode). Removing it switches LF to full 