t follow the WordPress naming convention: {textdomain}-{locale}.mo (e.g. vikbooking-ca.mo). They are stored in the uploads folder and survive plugin updates.','Override file uploaded successfully.'=>'Override file uploaded successfully.','Override file deleted.'=>'Override file deleted.','No file was selected.'=>'No file was selected.','Only .mo files are accepted.'=>'Only .mo files are accepted.','The upload failed — please try again.'=>'The upload failed — please try again.','Could not save the file. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Could not save the file. Check that the uploads folder is writable.','Invalid filename.'=>'Invalid filename.','Security check failed — file path is not permitted.'=>'Security check failed — file path is not permitted.','An unknown error occurred.'=>'An unknown error occurred.','Text domain / locale'=>'Text domain / locale','Size'=>'Size','Delete all files for this override (both .mo and .po)?'=>'Delete all files for this override (both .mo and .po)?','Delete'=>'Delete','No override files uploaded yet.'=>'No override files uploaded yet.','Upload .mo file'=>'Upload .mo file','Accepts compiled .mo files only. Filename must follow the pattern {textdomain}-{locale}.mo. Uploading a file with the same name as an existing one will replace it.'=>'Accepts compiled .mo files only. Filename must follow the pattern {textdomain}-{locale}.mo. Uploading a file with the same name as an existing one will replace it.','Upload Override'=>'Upload Override','Loco Translate — Copy to Safe Storage'=>'Loco Translate — Copy to Safe Storage','Loco Translate stores its custom translations in wp-content/languages/loco/ — a location that can be silently wiped by a WP core update, plugin reinstall, or if Loco Translate itself is removed. Copying files here moves them into the Lingua Forge i18n-overrides directory, which persists through all of those events and is loaded automatically on every request.'=>'Loco Translate stores its custom translations in wp-content/languages/loco/ — a location that can be silently wiped by a WP core update, plugin reinstall, or if Loco Translate itself is removed. Copying files here moves them into the Lingua Forge i18n-overrides directory, which persists through all of those events and is loaded automatically on every request.','File copied to safe storage successfully.'=>'File copied to safe storage successfully.','Source file not found.'=>'Source file not found.','Could not copy the file. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Could not copy the file. Check that the uploads folder is writable.','Invalid file reference.'=>'Invalid file reference.','Type'=>'Type','✓ In safe storage'=>'✓ In safe storage','Copy to safe storage'=>'Copy to safe storage','No custom Loco Translate files found yet. They appear here once you save a translation in Loco Translate.'=>'No custom Loco Translate files found yet. They appear here once you save a translation in Loco Translate.','Lingua Forge outputs Open Graph and Twitter Card meta tags so shared URLs display the correct language, title, description, and image on social platforms.'=>'Lingua Forge outputs Open Graph and Twitter Card meta tags so shared URLs display the correct language, title, description, and image on social platforms.','Unlike hreflang — where LF always overrides other plugins because they cannot know your multilingual configuration — Open Graph is different: Yoast, Rank Math, and similar plugins already output correct OG tags for your content. Duplicating them adds no value. In auto mode, LF detects active SEO plugins and adds only what they cannot provide: og:locale (current language) and og:locale:alternate (all other configured languages).'=>'Unlike hreflang — where LF always overrides other plugins because they cannot know your multilingual configuration — Open Graph is different: Yoast, Rank Math, and similar plugins already output correct OG tags for your content. Duplicating them adds no value. In auto mode, LF detects active SEO plugins and adds only what they cannot provide: og:locale (current language) and og:locale:alternate (all other configured languages).','Open Graph settings saved.'=>'Open Graph settings saved.','Open Graph output'=>'Open Graph output','Output Open Graph tags in wp_head'=>'Output Open Graph tags in wp_head','Output mode'=>'Output mode','Auto (recommended)'=>'Auto (recommended)','Detect active SEO plugins (Yoast, Rank Math, etc.) at runtime. Emit only og:locale + og:locale:alternate when another plugin already outputs the full OG set; emit the complete set when none is detected.'=>'Detect active SEO plugins (Yoast, Rank Math, etc.) at runtime. Emit only og:locale + og:locale:alternate when another plugin already outputs the full OG set; emit the complete set when none is detected.','Locale only'=>'Locale only','Always emit only og:locale and og:locale:alternate. Use when another plugin or theme handles the full OG set.'=>'Always emit only og:locale and og:locale:alternate. Use when another plugin or theme handles the full OG set.','Full'=>'Full','Always emit the complete OG + Twitter Card set regardless of other plugins. Use only if no other plugin outputs OG tags.'=>'Always emit the complete OG + Twitter Card set regardless of other plugins. Use only if no other plugin outputs OG tags.','Disabled'=>'Disabled','Do not output any OG tags.'=>'Do not output any OG tags.','Default OG image'=>'Default OG image','Fallback image URL used when a page has no featured image, site logo, or site icon. Shown in social previews for archives, the blog index, and any singular page without a thumbnail.'=>'Fallback image URL used when a page has no featured image, site logo, or site icon. Shown in social previews for archives, the blog index, and any singular page without a thumbnail.','— Disabled'=>'— Disabled','✓ Active — locale tags only (og:locale, og:locale:alternate)'=>'✓ Active — locale tags only (og:locale, og:locale:alternate)','✓ Active — full OG + Twitter Cards'=>'✓ Active — full OG + Twitter Cards','Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin detected. LF is deferring the base OG set to the mu-plugin and outputting og:locale + og:locale:alternate only. You can deactivate the mu-plugin — LF\'s built-in Social Share (SEO → Social Share tab) and Open Graph cover the same functionality.'=>'Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin detected. LF is deferring the base OG set to the mu-plugin and outputting og:locale + og:locale:alternate only. You can deactivate the mu-plugin — LF\'s built-in Social Share (SEO → Social Share tab) and Open Graph cover the same functionality.','SEO plugin(s) detected: %s. LF is outputting og:locale and og:locale:alternate only; the detected plugin handles the full OG set.'=>'SEO plugin(s) detected: %s. LF is outputting og:locale and og:locale:alternate only; the detected plugin handles the full OG set.','No external OG plugin detected. LF is outputting the full OG + Twitter Card set.'=>'No external OG plugin detected. LF outputs the complete OG + Twitter Card set.','Save Open Graph Settings'=>'Save Open Graph Settings','Lingua Forge outputs Schema.org JSON-LD structured data so search engines understand your content type, language, and metadata. This is the primary way to communicate inLanguage annotations for multilingual content to Google and other crawlers.'=>'Lingua Forge outputs Schema.org JSON-LD structured data so search engines understand your content type, language, and metadata. This is the main way to communicate inLanguage annotations for multilingual content to Google and other crawlers.','Schema output deferred.'=>'Schema output deferred.','%s is active and already outputs Schema.org JSON-LD. Lingua Forge has disabled its own schema output to prevent conflicting graphs. Unlike Open Graph — where LF adds og:locale on top of another plugin\'s output — schema cannot be cleanly supplemented: duplicate or overlapping JSON-LD graphs produce validation errors. Disable schema output in the detected plugin if you want LF to handle structured data.'=>'%s is active and already outputs Schema.org JSON-LD. Lingua Forge has disabled its own schema output to prevent conflicting graphs. Unlike Open Graph — where LF adds og:locale on top of another plugin\'s output — schema cannot be cleanly supplemented: duplicate or overlapping JSON-LD graphs produce validation errors. Disable schema output in the detected plugin if you want LF to handle structured data.','Schema.org settings saved.'=>'Schema.org settings saved.','Schema.org output'=>'Schema.org output','Output Schema.org JSON-LD in wp_head'=>'Output Schema.org JSON-LD in wp_head','Locked — a conflicting SEO plugin is active. See the notice above.'=>'Locked — a conflicting SEO plugin is active. See the notice above.','Article / WebPage'=>'Article / WebPage','Output Article or WebPage schema on singular posts and pages'=>'Output Article or WebPage schema on singular posts and pages','Blog posts use Article; all other post types and pages use WebPage. Includes headline, description, inLanguage, url, datePublished, dateModified, image, and publisher.'=>'Blog posts use Article; all other post types and pages use WebPage. Includes headline, description, inLanguage, url, datePublished, dateModified, image, and publisher.','WebSite'=>'WebSite','Output WebSite schema on the front page and blog index'=>'Output WebSite schema on the front page and blog index','Includes site name, url, and inLanguage.'=>'Includes site name, url, and inLanguage.','Product'=>'Product','Output Product schema on WooCommerce product pages'=>'Output Product schema on WooCommerce product pages','Includes name, description, inLanguage, url, image, and an Offer with price, priceCurrency, and availability. Price and availability come from the source-language product (shared stock model).'=>'Includes name, description, inLanguage, url, image, and an Offer with price, priceCurrency, and availability. Price and availability come from the source-language product (shared stock model).','Currently emitting'=>'Currently emitting','Article / WebPage — all singular posts and pages'=>'Article / WebPage — all singular posts and pages','WebSite — front page / blog index'=>'WebSite — front page / blog index','Product — WooCommerce product pages'=>'Product — WooCommerce product pages','Nothing — all types disabled'=>'Nothing — all types disabled','Save Schema.org Settings'=>'Save Schema.org Settings','Blog / Editorial'=>'Blog / Editorial','Product / eCommerce'=>'Product / eCommerce','Landing / Short-form'=>'Landing / Short-form','Filter by language and post type, browse your content, and click Analyze on any item to run a rule-based SEO audit — title length, meta description, word count, heading structure, image alt coverage, and internal links.'=>'Filter by language and post type, browse your content, and click Analyze on any item to run a rule-based SEO audit — title length, meta description, word count, heading structure, image alt coverage, and internal links.','Treat H2 as H1 equivalent'=>'Treat H2 as H1 equivalent','Enable when your theme renders the post title as an H2 instead of an H1 (common in some block themes). The analyser fetches the rendered page and, if it finds no H1 but does find an H2, it promotes the first H2 to H1 for scoring purposes.'=>'Enable when your theme renders the post title as an H2 instead of an H1 (common in some block themes). The analyzer fetches the rendered page and, if it finds no H1 but does find an H2, it promotes the first H2 to H1 for scoring purposes.','Save analysis settings'=>'Save analysis settings','Per-Post Analysis'=>'Per-Post Analysis','Select a post and run a detailed SEO audit to see per-metric results and a score for that specific item.'=>'Select a post and run a detailed SEO audit to see per-metric results and a score for that specific item.','Language'=>'Language','source'=>'source','All types'=>'All types','Load content'=>'Load content','Batch Analysis'=>'Batch Analysis','Run a full SEO audit across all published posts for one or all active languages. Scores are saved per post and reflected in the Language column badges in the post list.'=>'Run a full SEO audit across all published posts for one or all active languages. Scores are saved per post and reflected in the Language column badges in the post list.','WooCommerce system pages (Shop, Cart, Checkout, My Account) are excluded — their content is managed by WooCommerce and cannot be improved through SEO edits.'=>'WooCommerce system pages (Shop, Cart, Checkout, My Account) are excluded — their content is managed by WooCommerce and cannot be improved through SEO edits.','Post type'=>'Post type','Default profile'=>'Default profile','— Auto-detect —'=>'— Auto-detect —','Analyse all languages'=>'Analyse all languages','Auto-detect assigns: WooCommerce products → Product profile; the static front page → Landing profile; everything else → Blog profile. Choose a specific profile to override this for all posts.'=>'Auto-detect assigns: WooCommerce products → Product profile; the static front page → Landing profile; everything else → Blog profile. Choose a specific profile to override this for all posts.','%d post'=>'%d post' . "\0" . '%d posts','Last run: %s ago'=>'Last run: %s ago','Never run'=>'Never run','avg'=>'avg','(partial)'=>'(partial)','Analyse'=>'Analyse','(no title) #%d'=>'(no title) #%d','Invalid post ID.'=>'Invalid post ID.','Post not found or not published.'=>'Post not found or not published.','~%d min read'=>'~%d min read' . "\0" . '~%d min read','No title set.'=>'No title set.','Title is %1$d chars — may be truncated in SERPs (aim for under %2$d).'=>'Title is %1$d chars — may be truncated in SERPs (aim for under %2$d).','Title is only %d chars — aim for at least 10 characters.'=>'Title is only %d chars — aim for at least 10 characters.','Single-word title (%d chars) — adding a second word improves clarity and keyword coverage.'=>'Single-word title (%d chars) — adding a second word improves clarity and keyword coverage.','%1$d chars, %2$d words — good title.'=>'%1$d characters, %2$d words — good title.','Using LF AI meta description.'=>'Using LF AI meta description.','No LF meta description set — using excerpt/content.'=>'No LF meta description set — using excerpt/content.','No meta description found. Generate one via the AI meta description feature.'=>'No meta description found. Generate one using the AI meta description feature.','%1$d chars — too short (aim for %2$d–%3$d). %4$s'=>'%1$d chars — too short (aim for %2$d–%3$d). %4$s','%1$d chars — likely truncated in SERPs (keep under %2$d). %3$s'=>'%1$d characters — likely truncated in SERPs (keep under %2$d). %3$s','%1$d chars — good, slightly above the ideal %2$d but within the accepted %3$d-char range. %4$s'=>'%1$d characters — good, slightly above the ideal %2$d but within the accepted %3$d-character range. %4$s','%1$d chars — ideal length. %2$s'=>'%1$d chars — ideal length. %2$s','%1$d words — very thin content. Consider expanding to at least %2$d words.'=>'%1$d words — very thin content. Consider expanding to at least %2$d words.','%1$d words — below recommended minimum of %2$d.'=>'%1$d words — below recommended minimum of %2$d.','%d words.'=>'%d words.','H2-as-H1 mode enabled — title counted as H1 equivalent. (Heading tags could not be detected from the rendered page; verify your theme outputs the title correctly.)'=>'H2-as-H1 mode enabled — title counted as H1 equivalent. (Heading tags could not be detected from the rendered page; verify your theme outputs the title correctly.)','No H1 found. Typically the post title is the H1 — verify your theme is outputting it.'=>'No H1 found. Usually, the post title is the H1 — verify your theme outputs it.','%d H1 tags found — a page should have exactly one H1.'=>'%d H1 tags found — a page should have exactly one H1.','1 H1 ✓ — no H2, but %d H3 subheading(s) found (e.g. accordion/details headers). Structure is acceptable.'=>'1 H1 ✓ — no H2, but %d H3 subheading(s) found (e.g., accordion/details headers). Structure is acceptable.','1 H1 ✓ — short content (%d paragraph(s)), subheadings not required.'=>'1 H1 ✓ — short content (%d paragraph(s)), subheadings not required.','1 H1 ✓ — no H2 subheadings (acceptable for this content type).'=>'1 H1 ✓ — no H2 subheadings (acceptable for this content type).','1 H1 ✓ — no H2 or H3 subheadings found. Adding H2s improves structure.'=>'1 H1 ✓ — no H2 or H3 subheadings found. Adding H2s improves structure.','1 H1 ✓, %1$d H2, %2$d H3.'=>'1 H1 ✓, %1$d H2, %2$d H3.','No images found in content.'=>'No images found in content.','%1$d of %2$d image(s) missing alt text.'=>'%1$d of %2$d images missing alt text.','%d image(s), all have alt text.'=>'%d images, all have alt text.','No links found. Internal links improve crawlability and user navigation.'=>'No links found. Internal links enhance crawlability and user navigation.','No links found.'=>'No links found.','%d external link(s), no internal links. Add internal links to related content.'=>'%d external link(s), no internal links. Add internal links to related content.','%d external link(s), no internal links.'=>'%d external link(s), no internal links.','%1$d internal, %2$d external.'=>'%1$d internal, %2$d external.','Post not found.'=>'Post not found.','No AI provider configured. Add an API key in Settings → API Keys.'=>'No AI provider configured. Add an API key in Settings → API Keys.','No response from AI provider. Check your API key and try again.'=>'No response from AI provider. Check your API key and try again.','AI returned an unexpected response format. Please try again.'=>'AI returned an unexpected response format. Please try again.','Lingua Forge generates a dedicated XML sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml that adds language alternate links for all your translated content. This sitemap complements the WordPress core sitemap and any SEO plugin sitemap — it does not replace them.'=>'Lingua Forge creates a dedicated XML sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml that includes language alternate links for all your translated content. This sitemap complements the WordPress core sitemap and any SEO plugin sitemap — it does not replace them.','The WordPress core sitemap lists all your content URLs. The LF sitemap tells search engines how language versions relate to each other via xhtml:link hreflang alternates. Submit both to Google Search Console for full coverage.'=>'The WordPress core sitemap lists all your content URLs. The LF sitemap tells search engines how language versions relate to each other via xhtml:link hreflang alternates. Submit both to Google Search Console for full coverage.','%s is active and generates its own sitemap. That sitemap is separate from LF\'s. Both should be submitted to Google Search Console: the SEO plugin sitemap lists your content; the LF sitemap adds the multilingual alternate links. LF\'s sitemap is announced in robots.txt automatically.'=>'%s is active and generates its own sitemap. That sitemap is separate from LF\'s. Both should be submitted to Google Search Console: the SEO plugin sitemap lists your content; the LF sitemap adds the multilingual alternate links. LF\'s sitemap is announced in robots.txt automatically.','Sitemap settings saved.'=>'Sitemap settings saved.','Sitemap cache flushed. It will be regenerated on the next visit to the sitemap URL.'=>'Sitemap cache flushed. It will be regenerated on the next visit to the sitemap URL.','Sitemap output'=>'Sitemap output','Generate the multilingual sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml'=>'Generate the multilingual sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml','When enabled, the sitemap URL is announced in robots.txt automatically and the cache is refreshed when translated content is saved.'=>'When enabled, the sitemap URL is announced in robots.txt automatically and the cache is refreshed when translated content is saved.','Sitemap URL'=>'Sitemap URL','Submit this URL to Google Search Console alongside your main sitemap.'=>'Submit this URL to Google Search Console alongside your main sitemap.','Not yet generated. The sitemap is built on the first visit to the sitemap URL and cached for 24 hours.'=>'Not yet generated. The sitemap is built on the first visit to the sitemap URL and cached for 24 hours.','✓ Active — %d URL entry with language alternates'=>'✓ Active — %d URL entry with language alternates' . "\0" . '✓ Active — %d URL entries with language alternates','No translated content found. The sitemap will populate once posts have been translated.'=>'No translated content found. The sitemap will populate once posts are translated.','Last generated: %s'=>'Last generated: %s','Save Sitemap Settings'=>'Save Sitemap Settings','Flush Sitemap Cache'=>'Flush Sitemap Cache','Forces the sitemap to regenerate on the next request. Use after bulk-importing or manually editing translation relationships.'=>'Forces the sitemap to regenerate on the next request. Use after bulk-importing or manually editing translation relationships.','IndexNow'=>'IndexNow','IndexNow is an open protocol supported by Bing, Yandex, and other search engines. When a translated post is published or updated, Lingua Forge automatically notifies all participating engines in a single push — no polling, no waiting for the next robots.txt crawl.'=>'IndexNow is an open protocol supported by Bing, Yandex, and other search engines. When a translated post is published or updated, Lingua Forge automatically notifies all participating engines in a single push — no polling, no waiting for the next robots.txt crawl.','IndexNow replaces the deprecated Bing and Yandex sitemap-ping endpoints. Google discovers sitemaps via the robots.txt Sitemap: directive as before.'=>'IndexNow replaces the deprecated Bing and Yandex sitemap-ping endpoints. Google discovers sitemaps via the robots.txt Sitemap: directive as before.','✓ All URLs submitted to IndexNow successfully.'=>'✓ All URLs submitted to IndexNow successfully.','No translated URLs found to submit. Publish some translated posts first.'=>'No translated URLs found to submit. Publish some translated posts first.','✗ IndexNow submission failed. Check that the key file is publicly reachable (see below) and try again.'=>'✗ IndexNow submission failed. Check that the key file is publicly reachable (see below) and try again.','Verification key'=>'Verification key','Key file served automatically at: %s'=>'Key file served automatically at: %s','Key could not be generated. Check that the site has write access to WordPress options.'=>'Key could not be generated. Check that the site has write access to WordPress options.','Key file status'=>'Key file status','✓ Key file is publicly reachable.'=>'✓ Key file is publicly reachable.','✗ Key file is not reachable.'=>'✗ Key file is not reachable.','IndexNow engines verify the key file before accepting submissions. If the file is not reachable, submissions will be rejected with a 403 error.'=>'IndexNow engines verify the key file before accepting submissions. If the file is not reachable, submissions will be rejected with a 403 error.','Common causes: full-page caching (clear it), a security plugin blocking .txt files, or a custom Nginx/Apache rule. The file is served by LF on every request — no physical file is written to disk.'=>'Common causes: full-page caching (clear it), a security plugin blocking .txt files, or a custom Nginx/Apache rule. The file is served by LF on every request — no physical file is written to disk.','Submit all URLs'=>'Submit all URLs','Submit all URLs via IndexNow'=>'Submit all URLs via IndexNow','Pushes every published, LF-managed URL to IndexNow in one batch. Automatic submission already runs on every publish/update — use this only after a bulk import or when setting up IndexNow for the first time.'=>'Pushes every published, LF-managed URL to IndexNow in one batch. Automatic submission already runs on every publish/update — use this only after a bulk import or when setting up IndexNow for the first time.','Google does not participate in IndexNow. It discovers sitemaps via the robots.txt Sitemap: directive — which LF has already configured. Use Google Search Console to monitor indexing coverage.'=>'Google does not participate in IndexNow. It discovers sitemaps via the robots.txt Sitemap: directive — which LF has already configured. Use Google Search Console to monitor indexing coverage.','Open Search Console →'=>'Open Search Console →','robots.txt'=>'robots.txt','robots.txt updated with Sitemap directive.'=>'robots.txt updated with Sitemap directive.','✓ Physical robots.txt found. LF\'s Sitemap directive is present.'=>'✓ Physical robots.txt found. LF\'s Sitemap directive is present.','A physical robots.txt file exists at the site root. WordPress\'s virtual robots.txt — and LF\'s Sitemap: filter — are bypassed. The LF sitemap is not announced to search engines.'=>'A physical robots.txt file exists at the site root. WordPress\'s virtual robots.txt — and LF\'s Sitemap: filter — are bypassed. The LF sitemap is not announced to search engines.','Add Sitemap directive to robots.txt'=>'Add Sitemap directive to robots.txt','Appends the following line to your existing robots.txt: %s'=>'Appends the following line to your existing robots.txt: %s','DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is set.'=>'DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is set.','Add the following line to your robots.txt manually:'=>'Add the following line to your robots.txt manually:','View current robots.txt'=>'View current robots.txt','No physical robots.txt file found. WordPress is generating it virtually and LF\'s Sitemap directive is included automatically.'=>'No physical robots.txt file found. WordPress generates it virtually, and LF\'s Sitemap directive is included automatically.','The following directive is active in your virtual robots.txt:'=>'The following directive is active in your virtual robots.txt:','File modifications are disabled (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS).'=>'File modifications are disabled (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS).','Could not write to robots.txt. Check file permissions.'=>'Could not write to robots.txt. Check file permissions.','Lingua Forge extends the WordPress Core Social Icons block with dynamic share URLs. Set any icon\'s link to a "share:" value and LF rewrites it to the correct share URL or JavaScript action at render time — no custom code or third-party plugin required.'=>'Lingua Forge extends the WordPress Core Social Icons block with dynamic share URLs. Set any icon\'s link to a "share:" value, and LF rewrites it to the correct share URL or JavaScript action during rendering — no custom code or third-party plugin needed.','Social Share settings saved.'=>'Social Share settings saved.','The lf-social-share mu-plugin is active. Lingua Forge\'s built-in Social Share is inactive — the mu-plugin handles share URL rewriting and the JS actions.'=>'The lf-social-share mu-plugin is active. Lingua Forge\'s built-in Social Share is inactive — the mu-plugin handles share URL rewriting and the JS actions.','Social Share'=>'Social Share','Enable Social Share URL rewriting for Social Icons blocks'=>'Enable Social Share URL rewriting for Social Icons blocks','Disabled because the lf-social-share mu-plugin is already providing this feature.'=>'Disabled because the lf-social-share mu-plugin is already providing this feature.','Save Social Share Settings'=>'Save Social Share Settings','How to use'=>'How to use','In the block editor, add a Social Icons block. For each icon, open the link settings and enter one of the "share:" values below as the URL. On the frontend, LF replaces it with the correct share URL for the current page.'=>'In the block editor, add a Social Icons block. For each icon, open the link settings and enter one of the "share:" values below as the URL. On the frontend, LF replaces it with the correct share URL for the current page.','External share services'=>'External share services','URL to enter'=>'URL to enter','Action'=>'Action','Share on Facebook'=>'Share on Facebook','Post on X / Twitter'=>'Post on X / 