 go to'=>'Fix: go to','Settings → General → Site Language'=>'Settings → General → Site Language','and set it to one of your actual content languages (e.g. %s).'=>'and set it to one of your actual content languages (e.g. %s).','Environment'=>'Environment','Lingua Forge version'=>'Lingua Forge version','WordPress version'=>'WordPress version','PHP version'=>'PHP version','Active theme'=>'Active theme','(FSE / block theme)'=>'(FSE / block theme)','(classic theme)'=>'(classic theme)','URL structure'=>'URL structure','Subdomain (de.example.com)'=>'Subdomain (de.example.com)','Path prefix (/de/)'=>'Path prefix (/de/)','WP instance language'=>'WP instance language','not a content language — see notice above'=>'not a content language — see notice above','Primary content language'=>'Primary content language','Active languages'=>'Active languages','PHP max_execution_time'=>'PHP max_execution_time','No PHP limit'=>'No PHP limit','(server/FPM timeout still applies)'=>'(server/FPM timeout still applies)','AI translation and batch analysis may time out. Recommend 120s or more.'=>'AI translation and batch analysis may time out. Recommend 120s or more.','PHP memory_limit'=>'PHP memory_limit','AI Configuration'=>'AI Configuration','(active)'=>'(active)','Configured'=>'Configured','No key'=>'No key','— AI features are disabled.'=>'— AI features are disabled.','Add key →'=>'Add key →','Light model'=>'Light model','Quality model'=>'Quality model','Active preset'=>'Active preset','Daily quota'=>'Daily quota','Unlimited'=>'Unlimited','requests / day'=>'requests / day','Permalink Structure'=>'Permalink Structure','Permalink structure is compatible with Lingua Forge path routing.'=>'Permalink structure is compatible with Lingua Forge path routing.','Plain permalinks are not supported.'=>'Plain permalinks are not supported.','Path routing requires a post-name based permalink structure. Change it in'=>'Path routing requires a post-name based permalink structure. Change it in','Settings → Permalinks'=>'Settings → Permalinks','Numeric permalink structure is not supported.'=>'Numeric permalink structure is not supported.','Switch to a post-name based structure in'=>'Switch to a post-name based structure in','SEO Plugins'=>'SEO Plugins','No third-party SEO plugins detected. Lingua Forge handles all multilingual SEO output.'=>'No third-party SEO plugins detected. Lingua Forge handles all multilingual SEO output.','Active: %s.'=>'Active: %s.','See Settings → SEO → Compatibility for the full per-feature behaviour table.'=>'See Settings → SEO → Compatibility for the full per-feature behaviour table.','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','WooCommerce is not active.'=>'WooCommerce is not active.','Shop'=>'Shop','Cart'=>'Cart','Checkout'=>'Checkout','My Account'=>'My Account','WooCommerce version'=>'WooCommerce version','Order storage'=>'Order storage','High-Performance Order Storage (HPOS)'=>'High-Performance Order Storage (HPOS)','Custom tables — LF post-meta filters do not affect orders.'=>'Custom tables — LF post-meta filters do not affect orders.','Shared / compatibility mode'=>'Shared / compatibility mode','HPOS + CPT synced — transitional; LF post-meta filters apply to CPT copy.'=>'HPOS + CPT synced — transitional; LF post-meta filters apply to CPT copy.','Legacy post-based (CPT)'=>'Legacy post-based (CPT)','Orders in wp_posts — ensure shop_order is excluded from LF routing.'=>'Orders in wp_posts — ensure shop_order is excluded from LF routing.','WcPageBridge active'=>'WcPageBridge active','Yes'=>'Yes','No — WooCommerce integration class not loaded'=>'No — WooCommerce integration class not loaded','WooCommerce page translations'=>'WooCommerce page translations','No secondary languages configured.'=>'No secondary languages configured.','Active Plugins'=>'Active Plugins','No active plugins detected.'=>'No active plugins detected.','Version'=>'Version','_lf_lang Coverage'=>'_lf_lang Coverage','Posts without _lf_lang are invisible to every Lingua Forge language filter. This can happen when content is imported or created before the plugin was activated.'=>'Posts without _lf_lang are invisible to every Lingua Forge language filter. This can happen when content is imported or created before the plugin was activated.','All published posts have a _lf_lang value. No gaps detected.'=>'All published posts have a _lf_lang value. No gaps detected.','Missing'=>'Missing','Exclude this post type from language routing — its posts will no longer appear here or receive _lf_lang. This cannot be undone automatically.'=>'Exclude this post type from language routing — its posts will no longer appear here or receive _lf_lang. This cannot be undone automatically.','Exclude from routing'=>'Exclude from routing','excluded from routing'=>'excluded from routing','Destructive action — read before proceeding'=>'Destructive action — read before proceeding','Repair tags every routable post listed above with _lf_lang = %s. Posts in routing-excluded post types are not touched. Only run this after importing content or on initial activation — do not use as a bulk language-reassignment tool.'=>'Repair tags every routable post listed above with _lf_lang = %s. Posts in routing-excluded post types are not touched. Only run this after importing content or on initial activation — do not use as a bulk language-reassignment tool.','Repair — assign _lf_lang = %s to all routable posts above'=>'Repair — assign _lf_lang = %s to all routable posts above','Rewrite Rules'=>'Rewrite Rules','LF-owned entries currently registered in $wp_rewrite->extra_rules_top. Useful for diagnosing 404s or routing conflicts. Copy these when filing a bug report.'=>'LF-owned entries currently registered in $wp_rewrite->extra_rules_top. Useful for diagnosing 404s or routing conflicts. Copy these when filing a bug report.','%d rule registered'=>'%d rule registered' . "\0" . '%d rules registered','No LF rewrite rules found. Flush permalinks if this is unexpected.'=>'No LF rewrite rules found. Flush permalinks if this is unexpected.','Debug Info'=>'Debug Info','Copy and paste into a GitHub issue or support request.'=>'Copy and paste into a GitHub issue or support request.','Copy system info'=>'Copy system info','Copied!'=>'Copied!','Repairing…'=>'Repairing…','Repair failed.'=>'Repair failed.','Network error.'=>'Network error.','Exclude this post type from language routing? Its posts will no longer appear in this list or receive _lf_lang. You can reverse this in Settings → Router → Query Filter Exclusions.'=>'Exclude this post type from language routing? Its posts will no longer appear in this list or receive _lf_lang. You can reverse this in Settings → Router → Query Filter Exclusions.','Excluding…'=>'Excluding…','Failed to save exclusion.'=>'Failed to save exclusion.','%1$d post tagged with _lf_lang = %2$s.'=>'%1$d post tagged with _lf_lang = %2$s.' . "\0" . '%1$d posts tagged with _lf_lang = %2$s.','Uninstall Behaviour'=>'Uninstall Behaviour','Controls what happens when an administrator deletes the plugin from Plugins → Installed Plugins → Delete. Plugin settings and AI caches are always removed. Language assignments and translation relationships are kept by default so an accidental uninstall or a reinstall can pick up where it left off.'=>'Controls what happens when an administrator deletes the plugin from Plugins → Installed Plugins → Delete. Plugin settings and AI caches are always removed. Language assignments and translation relationships are kept by default so an accidental uninstall or a reinstall can pick up where it left off.','Uninstall setting saved.'=>'Uninstall setting saved.','Delete content data on uninstall'=>'Delete content data on uninstall','Also delete language assignments, translation relationships, meta descriptions, glossary, and Translation Memory when the plugin is uninstalled'=>'Also delete language assignments, translation relationships, meta descriptions, glossary, and Translation Memory when the plugin is uninstalled','Warning:'=>'Warning:','If checked, uninstalling the plugin will permanently delete all language assignments, translation relationships, meta descriptions, per-page presets, the AI glossary, and Translation Memory for every post on this site. This cannot be undone. Leave unchecked unless you are fully removing multilingual support from the site.'=>'If checked, uninstalling the plugin will permanently delete all language assignments, translation relationships, meta descriptions, per-page presets, the AI glossary, and Translation Memory for every post on this site. This cannot be undone. Leave unchecked unless you are fully removing multilingual support from the site.','Save Uninstall Setting'=>'Save Uninstall Setting','Today'=>'Today','Last 7 days'=>'Last 7 days','Last 30 days'=>'Last 30 days','All time'=>'All time','AI Usage'=>'AI Usage','Token consumption rolled up by feature, provider, and model. Recorded on every successful AI call; Test Connection pings are excluded so they don\'t skew the totals.'=>'Token consumption rolled up by feature, provider, and model. Recorded on every successful AI call; Test Connection pings are excluded so they don\'t skew the totals.','Check your account, billing, or remaining credits directly on the provider console:'=>'Check your account, billing, or remaining credits directly on the provider console:','Anthropic Console'=>'Anthropic Console','OpenAI Platform'=>'OpenAI Platform','Google AI Studio'=>'Google AI Studio','No AI usage recorded yet. Once an editor runs a translation, generates a meta description, or uses any other AI feature, totals will appear here.'=>'No AI usage recorded yet. Once an editor runs a translation, generates a meta description, or uses any other AI feature, totals will appear here.','No AI usage recorded in the selected window (%s). Pick a wider range above.'=>'No AI usage recorded in the selected window (%s). Pick a wider range above.','Provider'=>'Provider','Model'=>'Model','Requests'=>'Requests','Input tokens'=>'Input tokens','Output tokens'=>'Output tokens','Total tokens'=>'Total tokens','Total'=>'Total','Lingua Forge adds WooCommerce-specific Open Graph properties to product pages so that sharing a product URL on Facebook, Pinterest, and similar platforms surfaces the correct product type, price, and availability.'=>'Lingua Forge adds WooCommerce-specific Open Graph properties to product pages so that sharing a product URL on Facebook, Pinterest, and similar platforms displays the correct product type, price, and availability.','WooCommerce SEO settings saved.'=>'WooCommerce SEO settings saved.','Product Open Graph'=>'Product Open Graph','Add WooCommerce product tags to Open Graph output'=>'Add WooCommerce product tags to Open Graph output','When enabled, Lingua Forge outputs the following additional meta tags on product pages: og:type=product, og:price:amount, og:price:currency, og:availability, and their product: namespace equivalents used by Facebook Catalog.'=>'When enabled, Lingua Forge outputs the following additional meta tags on product pages: og:type=product, og:price:amount, og:price:currency, og:availability, and their product: namespace equivalents used by Facebook Catalog.','Tags emitted'=>'Tags emitted','Tag'=>'Tag','Value source'=>'Value source','"product" (replaces "article")'=>'"product" (replaces "article")','WooCommerce product price'=>'WooCommerce product price','WooCommerce store currency'=>'WooCommerce store currency','instock / oos / pending from WC stock status'=>'instock / oos / pending from WC stock status','Price and availability always reflect the source-language product (shared stock model). Tags are only output when LF\'s Open Graph module is set to "Full" or "Auto" mode with no conflicting SEO plugin detected.'=>'Price and availability always reflect the source-language product (shared stock model). Tags are only output when LF\'s Open Graph module is set to "Full" or "Auto" mode with no conflicting SEO plugin detected.','Save WooCommerce SEO Settings'=>'Save WooCommerce SEO Settings','AI Provider'=>'AI Provider','AI Usage & Cache'=>'AI Usage & Cache','API Keys'=>'API Keys','Keys are encrypted with AES-256-CBC before being stored in the WordPress database. The encryption secret is derived from your WordPress auth salts (wp-config.php), so plaintext keys never touch the database.'=>'Keys are encrypted with AES-256-CBC before being stored in the WordPress database. The encryption secret is derived from your WordPress auth salts (wp-config.php), so plaintext keys never touch the database.','API credentials are managed by WordPress in %s. No key is stored by Lingua Forge.'=>'API credentials are managed by WordPress in %s. No key is stored by Lingua Forge.','Settings → Connectors'=>'Settings → Connectors','API Key'=>'API Key','Paste your API key…'=>'Paste your API key…','✓ Configured'=>'✓ Configured','✗ Not configured'=>'✗ Not configured','Test connection'=>'Test connection','Leave blank to keep the existing key. Enter a new value to replace it.'=>'Leave blank to keep the existing key. Enter a new value to replace it.','Remove stored key'=>'Remove stored key','This key is currently supplied by a server %s and cannot be removed here. Enter a new key above to override it with a database value.'=>'This key is currently supplied by a server %s and cannot be removed here. Enter a new key above to override it with a database value.','environment variable'=>'environment variable','PHP constant'=>'PHP constant','Alternative (server-side):'=>'Alternative (server-side):','You can also define keys as constants or environment variables (e.g. in wp-config.php). Those sources are used automatically as a fallback when no database key is stored.'=>'You can also define keys as constants or environment variables (e.g., in wp-config.php). Those sources are used automatically as a fallback when no database key is stored.','To use a custom encryption secret (instead of the derived wp_salt value), add this to wp-config.php:'=>'To use a custom encryption secret (instead of the derived wp_salt value), add this to wp-config.php:','Unknown provider.'=>'Unknown provider.','No API key configured for this provider.'=>'No API key configured for this provider.','Could not instantiate the provider.'=>'Could not instantiate the provider.','Provider returned no response. Check the WordPress error log for details.'=>'Provider returned no response. Check the WordPress error log for details.','Enter a model identifier to test.'=>'Enter a model identifier to test.','No published post or page found to test with — publish some content first, or try Quick Translate directly.'=>'No published post or page found to test with — publish some content first, or try Quick Translate directly.','(untitled)'=>'(untitled)','Prompt template not found.'=>'Prompt template not found.','Translation failed. Please try again.'=>'Translation failed. Please try again.','The sample post has no visible text content to translate.'=>'The sample post has no visible text content to translate.','Chunk prompt template not found.'=>'Chunk prompt template not found.','Model returned no response. Check the WordPress error log for details.'=>'Model returned no response. Check the WordPress error log for details.','Behavior'=>'Behavior','Block Editor'=>'Block Editor','Lingua Forge restricts two Gutenberg features by default to keep editorial behavior consistent across languages. Opt in here when you need full Gutenberg / FSE capabilities.'=>'Lingua Forge restricts two Gutenberg features by default to keep editorial behavior consistent across languages. Opt in here when you need full Gutenberg / FSE capabilities.','Block locking'=>'Block locking','Allow editors to lock individual blocks'=>'Allow editors to lock individual blocks','Re-enables Gutenberg\'s canLockBlocks. Useful for editorial templates that need to prevent contributors from moving or deleting specific blocks.'=>'Re-enables Gutenberg\'s canLockBlocks. Useful for editorial templates that need to prevent contributors from moving or deleting specific blocks.','Template mode'=>'Template mode','Allow Gutenberg template-editing mode on post screens'=>'Allow Gutenberg template-editing mode on post screens','Re-enables supportsTemplateMode. Core to Full-Site-Editing workflows where post-level template overrides are intentional.'=>'Re-enables supportsTemplateMode. Core to Full-Site-Editing workflows where post-level template overrides are intentional.','Compliance Preset'=>'Compliance Preset','Strict-preservation mode for legal, regulatory, medical, or technical content. When on, every AI feature uses a low sampling temperature and appends the addendum below to its system prompt — terminology, article numbers, units, brand names, and regulatory language are preserved verbatim rather than paraphrased.'=>'Strict-preservation mode for legal, regulatory, medical, or technical content. When on, every AI feature uses a low sampling temperature and appends the addendum below to its system prompt — terminology, article numbers, units, brand names, and regulatory language are preserved verbatim rather than paraphrased.','Global AI preset'=>'Global AI preset','T=%s'=>'T=%s','T=0.2–0.6, per feature'=>'T=0.2–0.6, per feature','Sets the default AI behaviour for all features site-wide. Individual posts can override this for Translation and Content Generation via the Lingua Forge meta box.'=>'Sets the default AI behaviour for all features site-wide. Individual posts can override this for Translation and Content Generation via the Lingua Forge meta box.','Standard uses each feature\'s own tuned temperature: Translation T=0.2 (precise), Quick Translate T=0.4, Content Generator T=0.6 (creative). The other presets apply a single fixed temperature across all features.'=>'Standard uses each feature\'s own tuned temperature: Translation T=0.2 (precise), Quick Translate T=0.4, Content Generator T=0.6 (creative). The other presets apply a single fixed temperature across all features.','Technical / Scientific instructions'=>'Technical / Scientific instructions','Legal / Compliance instructions'=>'Legal / Compliance instructions','Creative / Marketing instructions'=>'Creative / Marketing instructions','Leave blank to use the built-in default. Clearing a saved override restores the default on next save.'=>'Leave blank to use the built-in default. Clearing a saved override restores the default on next save.','View built-in default'=>'View built-in default','Automatic Translation Backfill'=>'Automatic Translation Backfill','Periodically scans for posts missing a translation in an active language and queues an AI translation for each gap found — the same recovery you can already trigger by hand via "Translate missing" or the WP-CLI missing_translations/fill_translations commands, run automatically once an hour instead.'=>'Periodically scans for posts missing a translation in an active language and queues an AI translation for each gap found — the same recovery you can already trigger by hand via "Translate missing" or the WP-CLI missing_translations/fill_translations commands, run automatically once an hour instead.','Automatic backfill'=>'Automatic backfill','Automatically translate posts missing a language version'=>'Automatically translate posts missing a language version','Off by default. This feature makes AI provider requests — and spends the associated API cost — automatically and in the background, with no per-request confirmation, for every published post found without a translation in an active language. Turn this on only if you want every content gap translated unattended; otherwise use "Translate missing" or the WP-CLI commands to translate on your own schedule.'=>'Off by default. This feature makes AI provider requests — and spends the associated API cost — automatically and in the background, with no per-request confirmation, for every published post found without a translation in an active language. Turn this on only if you want every content gap translated unattended; otherwise use "Translate missing" or the WP-CLI commands to translate on your own schedule.','WooCommerce products and variations are never included, regardless of this setting. An integration can also block specific post types via the linguaforge_cpt_create_allowed filter.'=>'WooCommerce products and variations are never included, regardless of this setting. An integration can also block specific post types via the linguaforge_cpt_create_allowed filter.','Comment Translation'=>'Comment Translation','Mirrors an approved comment onto every language version of the post it belongs to, translated, as a real comment on each sibling page. Off by default.'=>'Mirrors an approved comment onto every language version of the post it belongs to, translated, as a real comment on each sibling page. Off by default.','Comment translation'=>'Comment translation','Enable comment translation'=>'Enable comment translation','Off by default. This feature makes AI provider requests — and spends the associated API cost — for approved comments on any post that has translated language versions. WooCommerce product reviews are never included; they already share one review pool across languages.'=>'Off by default. This feature makes AI provider requests — and spends the associated API cost — for approved comments on any post that has translated language versions. WooCommerce product reviews are never included; they already share one review pool across languages.','Translation trigger'=>'Translation trigger','Manual — translate only via the Comments screen action'=>'Manual — translate only via the Comments screen action','Automatic — translate every comment as soon as it\'s approved'=>'Automatic — translate every comment as soon as it\'s approved','Manual (default) queues nothing automatically — use the "Translate missing" bulk action on the Comments screen on your own schedule. Automatic queues a translation the moment a comment is approved (or arrives already-approved), which can spend API calls on comments a moderator was about to reject if there\'s a large held-for-moderation backlog.'=>'Manual (default) queues nothing automatically — use the "Translate missing" bulk action on the Comments screen on your own schedule. Automatic queues a translation the moment a comment is approved (or arrives already-approved), which can spend API calls on comments a moderator was about to reject if there\'s a large held-for-moderation backlog.','Max nested-reply depth'=>'Max nested-reply depth','How many levels of nested replies "Translate missing" will walk and translate in one pass, counting the original top-level comment as level 0. Default 2 covers the original comment plus replies and replies-to-replies. Bounds AI spend on deep threads — anything nested deeper isn\'t backfilled until this is raised or a further pass runs.'=>'How many levels of nested replies "Translate missing" will walk and translate in one pass, counting the original top-level comment as level 0. Default 2 covers the original comment plus replies and replies-to-replies. Bounds AI spend on deep threads — anything nested deeper isn\'t backfilled until this is raised or a further pass runs.','The "Sync" button in the post list Lang column retranslates a post out into every other language, including the primary/source post when it\'s run from a translation. That back-translation direction is restricted by default for every post type. (WooCommerce products and variations have their own separate setting below — this one does not affect them.)'=>'The "Sync" button in the post list Lang column retranslates a post out into every other language, including the primary/source post when it\'s run from a translation. That back-translation direction is restricted by default for every post type. (WooCommerce products and variations have their own separate setting below — this one does not affect them.)','Secondary-language Sync'=>'Secondary-language Sync','Allow "Sync" on a translated post to overwrite the primary post'=>'Allow "Sync" on a translated post to overwrite the primary post','Off by default: clicking "Sync" on a translation is blocked from overwriting the primary post. Syncing FROM the primary post to every translation is always allowed regardless of this setting. Turn this on only if you intentionally want a translation to be able to become the new source content.'=>'Off by default: clicking "Sync" on a translation is blocked from overwriting the primary post. Syncing FROM the primary post to every translation is always allowed regardless of this setting. Turn this on only if you intentionally want a translation to be able to become the new source content.','The primary-language product is WooCommerce\'s operational source of truth for price, SKU, and stock, which are always served from it regardless of which language a shopper is viewing. This is a separate, independent setting from the general "Sync" restriction above — enabling one does not enable the other.'=>'The primary-language product is WooCommerce\'s operational source of truth for price, SKU, and stock, which are always served from it regardless of which language a shopper is viewing. This is a separate, independent setting from the general "Sync" restriction above — enabling one does not enable the other.','Allow "Sync" on a translated product to overwrite the primary product'=>'Allow "Sync" on a translated product to overwrite the primary product','Off by default: clicking "Sync" on a translated WooCommerce product is blocked, since it would back-translate onto the primary product\'s title, description, and excerpt. Syncing FROM the primary product to every translation is always allowed regardless of this setting. Turn this on only if you intentionally want a translation to be able to become the new source content.'=>'Off by default: clicking "Sync" on a translated WooCommerce product is blocked, since it would back-translate onto the primary product\'s title, description, and excerpt. Syncing FROM the primary product to every translation is always allowed regardless of this setting. Turn this on only if you intentionally want a translation to be able to become the new source content.','General'=>'General','Light'=>'Light','Meta Description, Excerpt Generator, quick translate'=>'Meta Description, Excerpt Generator, quick translate','Quality'=>'Quality','Full-page Translation, Content Generator (mid-tier models are fully sufficient)'=>'Full-page Translation, Content Generator (mid-tier models are fully sufficient)','Active Provider'=>'Active Provider','Currently inherited from the %s constant. Selecting a value here will override it.'=>'Currently inherited from the %s constant. Selecting a value here will override it.','WordPress AI Client — requirements:'=>'WordPress AI Client — requirements:','Full-page translation uses JSON-schema-constrained output. This requires a connector plugin to be installed and active (not just an API key saved in Settings → Connectors). If translation fails, check the PHP error log for the specific error, or switch to a built-in provider.'=>'Full-page translation uses JSON-schema-constrained output. This requires a connector plugin to be installed and active (not just an API key saved in Settings → Connectors). If translation fails, check the PHP error log for the specific error, or switch to a built-in provider.','Manage your account, review usage, or top up credits:'=>'Manage your account, review usage, or top up credits:','WordPress Connectors'=>'WordPress Connectors','Models'=>'Models','Features are grouped into two tiers. Enter the exact model identifier for each tier and provider. Leave a field blank to use the built-in default (shown as placeholder). Only the active provider\'s models are called at runtime — configure the others in advance if you plan to switch.'=>'Features are grouped into two tiers. Enter the exact model identifier for each tier and provider. Leave a field blank to use the built-in default (shown as placeholder). Only the active provider\'s models are called at runtime — configure the others in advance if you plan to switch.','Start typing in any field to see model suggestions, or use the reference table below. Light and mid-tier Quality models (Haiku, GPT-4o mini, Gemini Flash) are fully sufficient for translation and content generation — flagship "max" models add cost with minimal quality gain for structured text.'=>'Start typing in any field to see model suggestions, or use the reference table below. Light and mid-tier Quality models (Haiku, GPT-4o mini, Gemini Flash) are fully sufficient for translation and content generation — flagship "max" models add cost with minimal quality gain for structured text.','active'=>'active','Model selection is managed by WordPress in %s — no model identifier is stored by Lingua Forge for this provider.'=>'Model selection is managed by WordPress in %s — no model identifier is stored by Lingua Forge for this provider.','overridden'=>'overridden','Translates a short sample of your most recent published post with this exact model — a real, billed API call.'=>'Translates a short sample of your most recent published post with this exact model — a real, billed API call.','Test model'=>'Test model','Tip: to reset a model to the built-in default, clear the field and save.'=>'Tip: to reset a model to the built-in default, clear the field and save.','Available models reference'=>'Available models reference','Model ID'=>'Model ID','Name'=>'Name','Tier'=>'Tier','Notes'=>'Notes','This catalog is updated with each Lingua Forge release. Testing a connection in the API Keys tab also fetches the live model list from the provider and refreshes the suggestions above.'=>'This catalog is updated with each Lingua Forge release. Testing a connection in the API Keys tab also fetches the live model list from the provider and refreshes the suggestions above.','Glossary'=>'Glossary','User-managed terminology table per language pair. Entries are appended to the translation system prompt so the AI uses preferred terms consistently — critical for domain vocabulary ("kWp", "PPA", "interconnection point"), brand names that must not translate, and standardised regulatory phrasing. Both language fields are optional: leave "Source language" blank to apply the entry regardless of which language you are translating from; leave "Target language" blank to apply it to all target languages at once.'=>'User-managed terminology table per language pair. Entries are appended to the translation system prompt so the AI uses preferred terms consistently — critical for domain vocabulary ("kWp", "PPA", "interconnection point"), brand names that must not translate, and standardised regulatory phrasing. Both language fields are optional: leave "Source language" blank to apply the entry regardless of which language you are translating from; leave "Target language" blank to apply it to all target languages at once.','Glossary entry added.'=>'Glossary entry added.','Glossary entry removed.'=>'Glossary entry removed.','Could not add entry: source term and target term are required.'=>'Could not add entry: source term and target term are required.','Could not save the glossary entry.'=>'Could not save the glossary entry.','Source language'=>'Source language','— Any —'=>'— Any —','Target language'=>'Target language','— Any target —'=>'— Any target —','Filter'=>'Filter','Reset'=>'Reset','No glossary entries match the current filter. Clear the filter to see all entries, or add a new entry below.'=>'No glossary entries match the current filter. Clear the filter to see all entries, or add a new entry below.','No glossary entries yet. Add one below to start enforcing terminology in translations.'=>'No glossary entries yet. Add one below to start enforcing terminology in translations.','Source term'=>'Source term','Target term'=>'Target term','Source lang'=>'Source lang','Target lang'=>'Target lang','any'=>'any','Delete this glossary entry?'=>'Delete this glossary entry?','Add new entry'=>'Add new entry','The phrase as it appears in the source text.'=>'The phrase as it appears in the source text.','How it should appear in the translation. Type the same value as the source term to instruct the AI to preserve it verbatim.'=>'How it should appear in the translation. Type the same value as the source term to instruct the AI to preserve it verbatim.','— Any source language —'=>'— Any source language —','Leave blank for brand names and language-agnostic terms that should be enforced regardless of which language we are translating from.'=>'Leave blank for brand names and language-agnostic terms that should be enforced regardless of which language we are translating from.','— Any target language —'=>'— Any target language —','Leave blank to apply this entry to all target languages — ideal for brand names, abbreviations, and terms that must be preserved verbatim in every translation.'=>'Leave blank to apply this entry to all target languages — ideal for brand names, abbreviations, and terms that must be preserved verbatim in every translation.','Optional context for editors (e.g. "ASIC = Application-Specific Integrated Circuit; preserve in English in technical contexts").'=>'Optional context for editors (e.g. "ASIC = Application-Specific Integrated Circuit; preserve in English in technical contexts").','Add entry'=>'Add entry','Limits'=>'Limits','Authors and above (edit_published_posts)'=>'Authors and above (edit_published_posts)','Contributors and above — default (edit_posts)'=>'Contributors and above — default (edit_posts)','Editors and above (edit_others_posts)'=>'Editors and above (edit_others_posts)','Administrators only (manage_options)'=>'Administrators only (manage_options)','AI Limits & Security'=>'AI Limits & Security','Cap how much AI usage the site can generate and restrict which user roles may trigger paid AI calls. Sits on top of the per-user rate limit (30 requests / minute, hardcoded) that already protects against single-user runaway loops.'=>'Cap how much AI usage the site can generate and restrict which user roles may trigger paid AI calls. Sits on top of the per-user rate limit (30 requests / minute, hardcoded) that already protects against single-user runaway loops.','Daily request limit'=>'Daily request limit','Site-wide ceiling on AI requests per UTC day (counts both Toolbar translations and block revisions). Counter resets at UTC midnight. Set to 0 to disable the cap.'=>'Site-wide ceiling on AI requests per UTC day (counts both Toolbar translations and block revisions). Counter resets at UTC midnight. Set to 0 to disable the cap.','Minimum role'=>'Minimum role','Lowest WordPress capability allowed to trigger AI features. Tightening this on multi-author sites prevents Contributors or trial accounts from running paid AI calls. Override per-feature via the linguaforge_required_capability filter.'=>'Lowest WordPress capability allowed to trigger AI features. Tightening this on multi-author sites prevents Contributors or trial accounts from running paid AI calls. Override per-feature via the linguaforge_required_capability filter.','Translation Limits'=>'Translation Limits','Control how much content is sent to the AI and how large the response can be. Leave a field blank to use the built-in default (shown as placeholder). Raise these values if large pages are being cut off; lower them to reduce API costs.'=>'Control how much content is sent to the AI and how large the response can be. Leave a field blank to use the built-in default (shown as placeholder). Raise these values if large pages are being cut off; lower them to reduce API costs.','Model tier'=>'Model tier','Quality (default — Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)'=>'Quality (default — Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)','Light (fast and cost-effective — Haiku / Flash)'=>'Light (fast and cost-effective — Haiku / Flash)','Which model tier to use for full-page translation. Quality uses the model configured in the Models table above and is recommended for accurate, long-form translation. Switch to Light only if speed or cost is the priority and the content is short.'=>'Which model tier to use for full-page translation. Quality uses the model configured in the Models table above and is recommended for accurate, long-form translation. Switch to Light only if speed or cost is the priority and the content is short.','Max output tokens'=>'Max output tokens','Maximum number of tokens the AI may produce in a single translation response. If a translation is silently cut off at the end, increase this value. Default: 16 000.'=>'Maximum number of tokens the AI may produce in a single translation response. If a translation is silently cut off at the end, increase this value. Default: 16 000.','Max input characters'=>'Max input characters','Maximum number of characters of post content forwarded to the AI. 0 means no limit — the full content is always sent (recommended). Set a non-zero value only if your provider has a tight context window. A warning is written to the PHP error log whenever the content is trimmed.'=>'Maximum number of characters of post content forwarded to the AI. 0 means no limit — the full content is always sent (recommended). Set a non-zero value only if your provider has a tight context window. A warning is written to the PHP error log whenever the content is trimmed.','Quick Translation'=>'Quick Translation','Quick Translation is used for snippet/chunk mode — short passages translated on demand from the toolbar, editor, or block popovers. It uses a separate, lighter configuration from the full-page translation to keep responses fast and cost-effective.'=>'Quick Translation is used for snippet/chunk mode — short passages translated on demand from the toolbar, editor, or block popovers. It uses a separate, lighter configuration from the full-page translation to keep responses fast and cost-effective.','Light (default — fast and cost-effective)'=>'Light (default — fast and cost-effective)','Quality (Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)'=>'Quality (Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)','The Light tier uses the fast model configured in the Models table above (default: Haiku / Flash). Switch to Quality if you need the same translation accuracy as full-page mode for snippets.'=>'The Light tier uses the fast model configured in the Models table above (default: Haiku / Flash). Switch to Quality if you need the same translation accuracy as full-page mode for snippets.','Maximum tokens the AI may produce per quick translation. Default: 2 000.'=>'Maximum tokens the AI may produce per quick translation. Default: 2 000.','Maximum characters accepted from the input field. Default: 8 000.'=>'Maximum characters accepted from the input field. Default: 8 000.','Content Generator'=>'Content Generator','Controls the token budget and input limits for the AI Content Generator feature. Leave fields blank to use the built-in defaults.'=>'Controls the token budget and input limits for the AI Content Generator feature. Leave fields blank to use the built-in defaults.','Maximum tokens the AI may produce per generation run. Raise this if full articles are being cut off. Default: 8 192.'=>'Maximum tokens the AI may produce per generation run. Raise this if full articles are being cut off. Default: 8 192.','Max hints characters'=>'Max hints characters','Maximum characters read from the Hints field. Default: 2 000.'=>'Maximum characters read from the Hints field. Default: 2 000.','Max context characters'=>'Max context characters','Maximum characters of existing post content passed to the AI as seed context when no Hints are provided. Default: 6 000.'=>'Maximum characters of existing post content passed to the AI as seed context when no Hints are provided. Default: 6 000.','Maintenance'=>'Maintenance','Router'=>'Router','Primary language saved.'=>'Primary language saved.','Permalink rules flushed successfully.'=>'Permalink rules flushed successfully.','Language uninstalled. %d post deleted.'=>'Language uninstalled. %d post deleted.' . "\0" . 'Language uninstalled. %d posts deleted.','%d locale file removed.'=>'%d locale file removed.' . "\0" . '%d locale files removed.','%d pattern translation removed.'=>'%d pattern translation removed.' . "\0" . '%d pattern translations removed.','%d locale file could not be removed automatically (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is set). Delete it manually via your server or WP-CLI: wp language core uninstall <locale>'=>'%d locale file could not be removed automatically (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is set). Delete it manually via your server or WP-CLI: wp language core uninstall <locale>.' . "\0" . '%d locale files could not be removed automatically (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is set). Delete them manually via your server or WP-CLI: wp language core uninstall <locale>.','Primary Language'=>'Primary Language','The primary language is always served at the root of your site — no URL prefix in path mode, no language subdomain in subdomain mode. All other languages use either a /lang/ path prefix (e.g. example.com/de/) or a language subdomain (e.g. de.example.com), depending on the URL structure setting below.'=>'The primary language is always served at the root of your site — no URL prefix in path mode, no language subdomain in subdomain mode. All other languages use either a /lang/ path prefix (e.g. example.com/de/) or a language subdomain (e.g. de.example.com), depending on the URL structure setting below.','Primary language'=>'Primary language','After changing the primary language, flush permalinks (section below) for the URL routing to update.'=>'After changing the primary language, flush permalinks (section below) for the URL routing to update.','Path prefix — example.com/de/'=>'Path prefix — example.com/de/','Subdomain — de.example.com/'=>'Subdomain — de.example.com/','Subdomain mode requires your web server to point all language subdomains (e.g. de.example.com) to this WordPress installation. After switching modes, flush permalink rules and clear any caches. If your home URL includes www (e.g. www.example.com), use the lf_base_domain filter to set the bare apex domain so subdomains are constructed correctly.'=>'Subdomain mode requires your web server to point all language subdomains (e.g., de.example.com) to this WordPress installation. After switching modes, flush permalink rules and clear any caches. If your home URL includes www (e.g., www.example.com), use the lf_base_domain filter to set the bare apex domain so subdomains are constructed correctly.','Browser language redirect'=>'Browser language redirect','Redirect visitors to their preferred language based on the browser\'s Accept-Language header'=>'Redirect visitors to their preferred language based on the browser\'s Accept-Language header','When enabled, first-time visitors with no language cookie and no language prefix in the URL are redirected to the closest matching language version. The redirect is skipped if the browser\'s preferred language is not among the active router languages. Once a visitor selects a language via the switcher, the cookie takes priority and the browser header is ignored on all future visits.'=>'When enabled, first-time visitors with no language cookie and no language prefix in the URL are redirected to the closest matching language version. The redirect is skipped if the browser\'s preferred language is not among the active router languages. Once a visitor selects a language via the switcher, the cookie takes priority and the browser header is ignored on all future visits.','Query Filter Exclusions'=>'Query Filter Exclusions','Lingua Forge scopes secondary WP_Query instances (sidebar widgets, template blocks, plugin lookups) to the active language by injecting a _lf_lang meta constraint. Post types listed here are excluded from that constraint — their queries are always unfiltered.'=>'Lingua Forge scopes secondary WP_Query instances (sidebar widgets, template blocks, plugin lookups) to the active language by injecting a _lf_lang meta constraint. Post types listed here are excluded from that constraint — their queries are always unfiltered.','Contact Form 7 (wpcf7_contact_form), Flamingo contacts and inbound messages (flamingo_contact, flamingo_inbound), and WordPress language-pack sync storage (wp_sync_storage) are excluded automatically. Add any other third-party post types whose content should not be language-filtered, one per line or comma-separated.'=>'Contact Form 7 (wpcf7_contact_form), Flamingo contacts and inbound messages (flamingo_contact, flamingo_inbound), and WordPress language-pack sync storage (wp_sync_storage) are excluded automatically. Add any other third-party post types whose content should not be language-filtered, one per line or comma-separated.','Excluded post types'=>'Excluded post types','Post type slugs separated by commas or newlines. Changes take effect immediately on save — no permalink flush required.'=>'Post type slugs separated by commas or newlines. Changes take effect immediately on save — no permalink flush required.','WooCommerce Integration'=>'WooCommerce Integration','Controls how Lingua Forge integrates with WooCommerce order processing.'=>'Controls how Lingua Forge integrates with WooCommerce order processing.','Order line item source mapping'=>'Order line item source mapping','Normalize order line item product IDs to the source-language product at checkout'=>'Normalize order line item product IDs to the source-language product at checkout','When enabled (recommended), the product ID stored on each WooCommerce order line item is set to the source-language product. This ensures total_sales counts, WC Analytics revenue rows, and third-party ERP exports reference one product ID per SKU rather than one per language version. Trade-off: "View product" links in order emails and My Account lead to the source-language page. Disable only if a connected system relies on translated product IDs in orders. Use the linguaforge_wc_order_item_source_mapping filter for per-item overrides.'=>'When enabled (recommended), the product ID stored on each WooCommerce order line item is set to the source-language product. This ensures total_sales counts, WC Analytics revenue rows, and third-party ERP exports reference one product ID per SKU rather than one per language version. Trade-off: "View product" links in order emails and My Account lead to the source-language page. Disable only if a connected system relies on translated product IDs in orders. Use the linguaforge_wc_order_item_source_mapping filter for per-item overrides.','Save Router Settings'=>'Save Router Settings','Flush Permalinks'=>'Flush Permalinks','Regenerates WordPress rewrite rules so URL prefixes, language-specific slugs, and archive rewrites are all in sync. Necessary after changing the primary language or adding new language support.'=>'Regenerates WordPress rewrite rules so URL prefixes, language-specific slugs, and archive rewrites are all in sync. Necessary after changing the primary language or adding new language support.','Flush Permalink Rules'=>'Flush Permalink Rules','Active Languages'=>'Active Languages','Languages currently known to the router (derived from installed WordPress locale packs plus the primary language). Install additional language packs in the section below to make more languages available for routing and translation.'=>'Languages currently known to the router (derived from installed WordPress locale packs plus the primary language). Install additional language packs in the section below to make more languages available for routing and translation.','%d locale pack installed.'=>'%d locale pack installed.' . "\0" . '%d locale packs installed.','Install a Language'=>'Install a Language','Download and install a WordPress core language pack directly from WordPress.org. Once installed, the locale becomes available for URL routing and the AI translation workflow. The list of available languages is fetched on demand — click the button below to load it.'=>'Download and install a WordPress core language pack directly from WordPress.org. Once installed, the locale becomes available for URL routing and the AI translation workflow. The list of available languages is fetched on demand — click the button below to load it.','Language installation is disabled on this server. The DISALLOW_FILE_MODS constant is set in wp-config.php. Install language packs manually via WP-CLI: wp language core install de_DE'=>'Language installation is disabled on this server. The DISALLOW_FILE_MODS constant is set in wp-config.php. Install language packs manually via WP-CLI: wp language core install de_DE','Load available languages'=>'Load available languages','— select a language —'=>'— select a language —','Install'=>'Install','Language Setup'=>'Language Setup','No secondary languages configured. Install a language pack above to enable template scaffolding.'=>'No secondary languages configured. Install a language pack above to enable template scaffolding.','Select a language to manage its FSE templates, template parts, and navigation menus.'=>'Select a language to manage its FSE templates, template parts, and navigation menus.','Recreate All Languages'=>'Recreate All Languages','Recreate All Languages (Templates Only)'=>'Recreate All Languages (Templates Only)','Recreate All Languages (Template Parts Only)'=>'Recreate All Languages (Template Parts Only)','Cancel'=>'Cancel','Repair Template Metadata'=>'Repair Template Metadata','Fixes the Site Editor namespace and _lf_lang tag on all LF-scaffolded FSE templates stored in the database. Run this once after updating from an earlier version of Lingua Forge — it moves WooCommerce-derived templates from the active-theme group to the WooCommerce group in the Site Editor, and ensures all scaffolded templates are discoverable by coverage reports.'=>'Fixes the Site Editor namespace and _lf_lang tag on all LF-scaffolded FSE templates stored in the database. Run this once after updating from an earlier version of Lingua Forge — it moves WooCommerce-derived templates from the active-theme group to the WooCommerce group in the Site Editor, and ensures all scaffolded templates are discoverable by coverage reports.','Repair template metadata'=>'Repair template metadata','Request failed.'=>'Request failed.','Forbidden'=>'Forbidden','Danger Zone'=>'Danger Zone','Uninstall %s'=>'Uninstall %s','Permanently deletes all templates, template parts, patterns, navigation menus, posts, pages, custom post types, products, and product variations associated with this language. Also removes the WordPress locale pack files so this language no longer appears in the router. This action cannot be undone.'=>'Permanently deletes all templates, template parts, patterns, navigation menus, posts, pages, custom post types, products, and product variations associated with this language. Also removes the WordPress locale pack files so this language no longer appears in the router. This action cannot be undone.','This language matches the WordPress instance locale and cannot be uninstalled.'=>'This language matches the WordPress instance locale and cannot be uninstalled.','Permanently uninstall %s? This will delete all translated content for this language and cannot be undone.'=>'Permanently uninstall %s? This will delete all translated content for this language and cannot be undone.','Invalid language code.'=>'Invalid language code.','This language is protected and cannot be uninstalled.'=>'This language is protected and cannot be uninstalled.','Language installation is disabled on this server (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is set).'=>'Language installation is disabled on this server (DISALLOW_FILE_MODS is set).','Invalid locale code.'=>'Invalid locale code.','Language %s installed successfully.'=>'Language %s installed successfully.','Language pack installation failed. The language may already be installed, the locale code may be incorrect, or your server may block file writes.'=>'Language pack installation failed. The language may already be installed, the locale code may be incorrect, or your server may block file writes.','Navigations'=>'Navigations','Navigation translation requires an active AI provider. Configure an API key in the API Keys tab.'=>'Navigation translation requires an active AI provider. Configure an API key in the API Keys tab.','Navigation'=>'Navigation','Re-translate'=>'Re-translate','CPT Block Patterns'=>'CPT Block Patterns','Block patterns registered for custom post types. Use the Translate button to produce a language variant. The translated content is saved here and can be copied into any CPT post from the block editor Pattern inserter or used as a starting point for a Synced Pattern (Reusable Block).'=>'Block patterns registered for custom post types. Use the Translate button to produce a language variant. The translated content is saved here and can be copied into any CPT post from the block editor Pattern inserter or used as a starting point for a Synced Pattern (Reusable Block).','Pattern'=>'Pattern','Post Types'=>'Post Types','✓ Translation saved'=>'✓ Translation saved','View'=>'View','Template Parts'=>'Template Parts','Language-specific copies of the theme\'s template parts. Once scaffolded, templates are updated to reference the language-specific part.'=>'Language-specific copies of the theme\'s template parts. Once scaffolded, templates are updated to reference the language-specific part.','Re-create all'=>'Re-create all','Translate all'=>'Translate all','Fix all links'=>'Fix all links','Fix all navs'=>'Fix all navs','Part'=>'Part','Status / Actions'=>'Status / Actions','Create'=>'Create','Templates'=>'Templates','FSE templates seeded from the active theme. Create then customise in the Site Editor.'=>'FSE templates seeded from the active theme. Create then customise in the Site Editor.','Create missing'=>'Create missing','Fix all parts'=>'Fix all parts','SEO'=>'SEO','Multilingual SEO'=>'Multilingual SEO','Configure hreflang, Open Graph, Schema.org, sitemaps, and social sharing for every language on your site. Each section below handles one aspect of multilingual SEO.'=>'Configure hreflang, Open Graph, Schema.org, sitemaps, and social sharing for every language on your site. Each section below handles one aspect of multilingual SEO.','Open Graph &amp; Twitter Cards'=>'Open Graph & Twitter Cards','Schema.org'=>'Schema.org','Sitemap'=>'Sitemap','Analysis'=>'Analysis','Compatibility'=>'Compatibility','System'=>'System','Overview'=>'Overview','Lingua Forge Settings'=>'Lingua Forge Settings','Lingua Forge adds multilingual routing, AI-powered translation, hreflang SEO tags, and a language switcher to your WordPress site.'=>'Lingua Forge adds multilingual routing, AI-powered translation, hreflang SEO tags, and a language switcher to your WordPress site.','Use the tabs across the top of this page to configure each area. Changes to the Router tab take effect immediately; changes to AI keys and model settings apply to the next AI request.'=>'Use the tabs across the top of this page to configure each area. Changes to the Router tab take effect immediately; changes to AI keys and model settings apply to the next AI request.','After changing URL structure settings (path prefix ↔ subdomain), always visit Settings → Permalinks and click Save Changes to flush the rewrite rules.'=>'After changing URL structure settings (path prefix ↔ subdomain), always visit Settings → Permalinks and click Save Changes to flush the rewrite rules.','AI Provider Tab'=>'AI Provider Tab','Supported providers: Anthropic (Claude), OpenAI (GPT), Google (Gemini). Select the active provider from the dropdown — only one provider is used at a time. Enter an API key for that provider to enable AI features.'=>'Supported providers: Anthropic (Claude), OpenAI (GPT), Google (Gemini). Select the active provider from the dropdown — only one provider is used at a time. Enter an API key for that provider to enable AI features.','Keys are encrypted at rest using AES-256-GCM with a site-specific secret (LINGUAFORGE_SECRET). Do not share database exports without rotating the secret first.'=>'Keys are encrypted at rest using AES-256-GCM with a site-specific secret (LINGUAFORGE_SECRET). Do not share database exports without rotating the secret first.','AI features are optional. Language routing, hreflang, the language switcher, and the translation group system all work without a provider configured.'=>'AI features are optional. Language routing, hreflang, the language switcher, and the translation group system all work without a provider configured.','Model tiers'=>'Model tiers','Lingua Forge uses two model tiers per provider:'=>'Lingua Forge uses two model tiers per provider:','Light: used for meta descriptions and excerpt generation — fast, low cost.'=>'Light: used for meta descriptions and excerpt generation — fast, low cost.','Quality: used for post translation and content generation — higher quality, higher cost.'=>'Quality: used for post translation and content generation — higher quality, higher cost.','Leave a model field blank to use the built-in default for that tier. The placeholder text shows which model will be used.'=>'Leave a model field blank to use the built-in default for that tier. The placeholder text shows which model will be used.','Translation Limits & Behavior'=>'Translation Limits & Behavior','Translation Limits: control which user roles can trigger AI translation, and set a monthly token budget. Exceeding the budget suspends AI calls until the month resets.'=>'Translation Limits: control which user roles can trigger AI translation, and set a monthly token budget. Exceeding the budget suspends AI calls until the month resets.','Behavior: choose the AI preset (Literal, Balanced, Creative), add site-wide custom prompt instructions, enable or disable automatic post-save translation, and configure the Translation Memory.'=>'Behavior: choose the AI preset (Literal, Balanced, Creative), add site-wide custom prompt instructions, enable or disable automatic post-save translation, and configure the Translation Memory.','Translation Memory caches AI results by content hash, language pair, provider, and model. Editing a post invalidates the cache entry so the next translate call gets a fresh result.'=>'Translation Memory caches AI results by content hash, language pair, provider, and model. Editing a post invalidates the cache entry so the next translate call gets a fresh result.','Router Tab'=>'Router Tab','Primary language: the language your existing content is written in. All translations are produced from this language; changing it does not move or delete any posts.'=>'Primary language: the language your existing content is written in. All translations are produced from this language; changing it does not move or delete any posts.','URL structure: path-prefix mode (example.com/de/) requires no server changes. Subdomain mode (de.example.com) requires a wildcard DNS record, a wildcard SSL certificate, and a web server configuration change — see the Server Setup guide.'=>'URL structure: path-prefix mode (example.com/de/) requires no server changes. Subdomain mode (de.example.com) requires a wildcard DNS record, a wildcard SSL certificate, and a web server configuration change — see the Server Setup guide.','Active languages: add each language you want to support. Each language gets a URL prefix or subdomain and an hreflang tag in the page &lt;head&gt;.'=>'Active languages: add each language you want to support. Each language gets a URL prefix or subdomain and an hreflang tag in the page &lt;head&gt;.','WP site language requirement'=>'WP site language requirement','The WordPress site language (Settings → General → Site Language) must be set to one of the languages you use for content — either the primary content language or one of the secondary languages. It cannot be a language that has no content on the site.'=>'The WordPress site language (Settings → General → Site Language) must be set to one of the languages you use for content — either the primary content language or one of the secondary languages. It cannot be a language that has no content on the site.','Example of a supported configuration: WP site language = CA (Catalan), content languages = CA + ES.'=>'Example of a supported configuration: WP site language = CA (Catalan), content languages = CA + ES.','Example of an unsupported configuration: WP site language = EN (English), content languages = CA + ES only. English is not a content language, so Lingua Forge cannot map the WP locale to any translation group.'=>'Example of an unsupported configuration: WP site language = EN (English), content languages = CA + ES only. English is not a content language, so Lingua Forge cannot map the WP locale to any translation group.','When the WP site language is not a content language: WooCommerce product queries return zero results on all catalogue blocks; product image delegation fails; all language-filtered content queries break; the language switcher may show a spurious non-content language option. If you see a red configuration alert at the top of the Router or System tab, correct the site language first.'=>'When the WP site language is not a content language: WooCommerce product queries return zero results on all catalogue blocks; product image delegation fails; all language-filtered content queries break; the language switcher may show a spurious non-content language option. If you see a red configuration alert at the top of the Router or System tab, correct the site language first.','FSE localisation: scaffold, translate, and fix links in Full Site Editing templates and template parts directly from this tab.'=>'FSE localisation: scaffold, translate, and fix links in Full Site Editing templates and template parts directly from this tab.','Glossary Tab'=>'Glossary Tab','Pin terms that must not be translated or must always be rendered in a specific way (e.g. brand names, product names, acronyms). Glossary constraints are injected into every AI translation request for all features: post translation, meta description, excerpt, and FSE template translation.'=>'Pin terms that must not be translated or must always be rendered in a specific way (e.g. brand names, product names, acronyms). Glossary constraints are injected into every AI translation request for all features: post translation, meta description, excerpt, and FSE template translation.','Add one term per row. Both the source term and the target rendering are required. The language pair determines which translation jobs the constraint applies to.'=>'Add one term per row. Both the source term and the target rendering are required. The language pair determines which translation jobs the constraint applies to.','SEO Tab'=>'SEO Tab','Lingua Forge is a complete multilingual SEO solution. No additional SEO plugin or sitemap plugin is required.'=>'Lingua Forge is a complete multilingual SEO solution. No additional SEO plugin or sitemap plugin is required.','What LF provides: hreflang tags for every configured language, Open Graph and Twitter Card tags with og:locale and og:locale:alternate, Schema.org JSON-LD with inLanguage annotations, and a dedicated multilingual sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml with xhtml:link alternate entries for all translation groups.'=>'What LF provides: hreflang tags for every configured language, Open Graph and Twitter Card tags with og:locale and og:locale:alternate, Schema.org JSON-LD with inLanguage annotations, and a dedicated multilingual sitemap at /lf-sitemap.xml with xhtml:link alternate entries for all translation groups.','The sitemap is announced in robots.txt automatically. All major search engines — Google, Bing, Yandex — discover it from robots.txt. No manual submission is required.'=>'The sitemap is announced in robots.txt automatically. All major search engines — Google, Bing, Yandex — discover it from robots.txt. No manual submission is required.','SEO plugins and conflict avoidance:'=>'SEO plugins and conflict avoidance:','If you have Yoast SEO, Rank Math, All in One SEO, or SEOPress installed, Lingua Forge detects them and adapts to avoid duplicate output. For hreflang, LF takes over entirely and suppresses the plugin\'s output because those plugins cannot produce correct hreflang for a multilingual routing configuration. For Open Graph, LF adds only og:locale and og:locale:alternate — the multilingual signals the plugin cannot provide — and leaves the base OG set to the plugin. For Schema.org, LF disables its own output entirely to avoid conflicting JSON-LD graphs.'=>'If you have Yoast SEO, Rank Math, All in One SEO, or SEOPress installed, Lingua Forge detects them and adapts to avoid duplicate output. For hreflang, LF takes over entirely and suppresses the plugin\'s output because those plugins cannot produce correct hreflang for a multilingual routing configuration. For Open Graph, LF adds only og:locale and og:locale:alternate — the multilingual signals the plugin cannot provide — and leaves the base OG set to the plugin. For Schema.org, LF disables its own output entirely to avoid conflicting JSON-LD graphs.','The SEO → Compatibility tab shows the live detection status and explains exactly what LF is doing for each feature area.'=>'The SEO → Compatibility tab shows the live detection status and explains exactly what LF is doing for each feature area.','SEO Scores'=>'SEO Scores','SEO Score System'=>'SEO Score System','Score computation'=>'Score computation','Each post is scored 0–100 from six rule-based metrics: title, meta description, word count, heading structure, image alt coverage, and internal links. Ten points are always awarded for reading time (informational only). The remaining 90 points are distributed across the other metrics with weights that vary by content profile (see below).'=>'Each post is scored 0–100 from six rule-based metrics: title, meta description, word count, heading structure, image alt coverage, and internal links. Ten points are always awarded for reading time (informational only). The remaining 90 points are distributed across the other metrics with weights that vary by content profile (see below).','Each metric yields one of four statuses: ok (full weight), warn (50 % of weight), fail (0), or info (0, no penalty). A score ≥ 80 is green, 50–79 amber, below 50 red.'=>'Each metric yields one of four statuses: ok (full weight), warn (50 % of weight), fail (0), or info (0, no penalty). A score ≥ 80 is green, 50–79 amber, below 50 red.','Title scoring rules (all profiles): fail if empty; warn if fewer than 10 characters; warn if only one word; warn if longer than the profile\'s SERP limit (60 chars for Blog, 70 for Product/Landing); ok if at least 10 characters, at least 2 words, and within the SERP limit.'=>'Title scoring rules (all profiles): fail if empty; warn if fewer than 10 characters; warn if only one word; warn if longer than the profile\'s SERP limit (60 chars for Blog, 70 for Product/Landing); ok if at least 10 characters, at least 2 words, and within the SERP limit.','Content profiles and weights'=>'Content profiles and weights','Profiles adapt thresholds and weights to the type of content being analysed. Profile is resolved automatically; you can override it per analysis run from the profile dropdown.'=>'Profiles adapt thresholds and weights to the type of content being analysed. Profile is resolved automatically; you can override it per analysis run from the profile dropdown.','Blog / Editorial (default)'=>'Blog / Editorial (default)','Title 15 pts · Meta description 20 pts · Word count 15 pts · Headings 20 pts · Images 10 pts · Links 10 pts. Title SERP limit 60 chars; meta 120–210 chars; word count warns below 300, fails below 100; H2 required; internal links required.'=>'Title 15 pts · Meta description 20 pts · Word count 15 pts · Headings 20 pts · Images 10 pts · Links 10 pts. Title SERP limit 60 chars; meta 120–210 chars; word count warns below 300, fails below 100; H2 required; internal links required.','Auto-detected for WooCommerce products. Title 20 pts · Meta description 30 pts · Word count 15 pts · Headings 5 pts · Images 20 pts · Links 0 pts. Title SERP limit 70 chars; word count warns below 80, fails below 40; H2 and internal links optional.'=>'Auto-detected for WooCommerce products. Title 20 pts · Meta description 30 pts · Word count 15 pts · Headings 5 pts · Images 20 pts · Links 0 pts. Title SERP limit 70 chars; word count warns below 80, fails below 40; H2 and internal links optional.','Auto-detected for the static front page; can be selected manually. Title 20 pts · Meta description 30 pts · Word count 15 pts · Headings 10 pts · Images 15 pts · Links 0 pts. Title SERP limit 70 chars; word count warns below 150, fails below 60; H2 and internal links optional.'=>'Auto-detected for the static front page; can be selected manually. Title 20 pts · Meta description 30 pts · Word count 15 pts · Headings 10 pts · Images 15 pts · Links 0 pts. Title SERP limit 70 chars; word count warns below 150, fails below 60; H2 and internal links optional.','Heading structure rules'=>'Heading structure rules','Exactly one H1 is required. The H1 is normally the post title rendered by the theme — it is read from the live rendered page when possible, and from post content as a fallback.'=>'Exactly one H1 is required. The H1 is normally the post title rendered by the theme — it is read from the live rendered page when possible, and from post content as a fallback.','When the Blog profile requires an H2 and none is found, the analyser first checks for H3 subheadings before issuing a warning. Accordion and Details blocks default to H3 for their headers; those H3s are accepted as valid structure and produce an ok result, not a warning.'=>'When the Blog profile requires an H2 and none is found, the analyser first checks for H3 subheadings before issuing a warning. Accordion and Details blocks default to H3 for their headers; those H3s are accepted as valid structure and produce an ok result, not a warning.','Short content (3 paragraphs or fewer) is never penalised for missing subheadings, regardless of profile. A concise page does not benefit from forced heading structure.'=>'Short content (3 paragraphs or fewer) is never penalised for missing subheadings, regardless of profile. A concise page does not benefit from forced heading structure.','"Treat H2 as H1 equivalent" (Settings → SEO → Analysis): enable this when your theme renders the post title inside an H2 instead of an H1. The analyser promotes the first H2 to H1 so the score is not incorrectly penalised.'=>'"Treat H2 as H1 equivalent" (Settings → SEO → Analysis): enable this when your theme renders the post title inside an H2 instead of an H1. The analyser promotes the first H2 to H1 so the score is not incorrectly penalised.','Score history and badges'=>'Score history and badges','Every time a post is analysed the score is stored in post meta. The post list Lang column shows a colour-coded "SEO N" badge for any post that has been analysed at least once. When two scores are stored a delta indicator (↑N / ↓N) shows the change since the previous run.'=>'Every time a post is analysed the score is stored in post meta. The post list Lang column shows a colour-coded "SEO N" badge for any post that has been analysed at least once. When two scores are stored a delta indicator (↑N / ↓N) shows the change since the previous run.','AI Usage & Cache Tab'=>'AI Usage & Cache Tab','Token usage'=>'Token usage','The usage table shows AI token consumption broken down by feature (translation, meta description, excerpt, FSE template, batch analysis), provider, and model. Use the date-range buttons to filter by today, last 7 days, last 30 days, or all time.'=>'The usage table shows AI token consumption broken down by feature (translation, meta description, excerpt, FSE template, batch analysis), provider, and model. Use the date-range buttons to filter by today, last 7 days, last 30 days, or all time.','The daily quota (configured in Behavior → Limits) is tracked here. When the quota is reached, AI calls are suspended for the rest of the day. The table shows how much of the quota has been consumed.'=>'The daily quota (configured in Behavior → Limits) is tracked here. When the quota is reached, AI calls are suspended for the rest of the day. The table shows how much of the quota has been consumed.','Translation caching'=>'Translation caching','Lingua Forge uses two independent caching layers to reduce redundant AI API calls:'=>'Lingua Forge uses two independent caching layers to reduce redundant AI API calls:','Stores raw AI responses keyed by content hash, language pair, provider, model, and preset. Cache entries are invalidated automatically when the source post content changes. Clear individual post entries or the whole cache from this tab.'=>'Stores raw AI responses keyed by content hash, language pair, provider, model, and preset. Cache entries are invalidated automatically when the source post content changes. Clear individual post entries or the whole cache from this tab.','Stores the full translated post output per content hash. Opt-in (enabled in Behavior). Speeds up repeated translations of unchanged content. Clear it here when you want to force a fresh AI pass regardless of whether the content has changed.'=>'Stores the full translated post output per content hash. Opt-in (enabled in Behavior). Speeds up repeated translations of unchanged content. Clear it here when you want to force a fresh AI pass regardless of whether the content has changed.','Maintenance Tab'=>'Maintenance Tab','Language Overrides: manage custom .po/.mo override files for the Lingua Forge UI strings. Use this instead of editing plugin files directly — overrides survive updates.'=>'Language Overrides: manage custom .po/.mo override files for the Lingua Forge UI strings. Use this instead of editing plugin files directly — overrides survive updates.','Debug: enable the debug log to capture AI prompts and API responses to a local file. Disable after troubleshooting — debug mode writes a file on every AI request.'=>'Debug: enable the debug log to capture AI prompts and API responses to a local file. Disable after troubleshooting — debug mode writes a file on every AI request.','Uninstall Behaviour: controls what is deleted when the plugin is removed from Plugins → Installed Plugins → Delete. Plugin settings and AI caches are always removed. Language assignments, translation relationships, meta descriptions, glossary, and Translation Memory are kept by default so an accidental uninstall or reinstall can pick up where it left off. Enable "Delete content data on uninstall" only when you are fully removing multilingual support from the site — this cannot be undone.'=>'Uninstall Behavior: controls what is deleted when the plugin is removed from Plugins → Installed Plugins → Delete. Plugin settings and AI caches are always removed. Language assignments, translation relationships, meta descriptions, glossary, and Translation Memory are kept by default so an accidental uninstall or reinstall can pick up where it left off. Enable "Delete content data on uninstall" only when you are fully removing multilingual support from the site — this cannot be undone.','System Tab'=>'System Tab','Read-only diagnostics for the current installation. No settings are changed here — use it to verify configuration, spot problems, and gather information for bug reports.'=>'Read-only diagnostics for the current installation. No settings are changed here — use it to verify configuration, spot problems, and gather information for bug reports.','Sections'=>'Sections','Lingua Forge, WordPress, and PHP versions; active theme; URL structure; WP site language and primary content language. A red indicator next to the WP site language means it is not one of the active content languages — fix it in Settings → General before anything else.'=>'Lingua Forge, WordPress, and PHP versions; active theme; URL structure; WP site language and primary content language. A red indicator next to the WP site language means it is not one of the active content languages — fix it in Settings → General before anything else.','Active provider, configured keys, model tier selections, preset, and daily quota.'=>'Active provider, configured keys, model tier selections, preset, and daily quota.','Confirms the permalink structure is compatible with Lingua Forge path routing. Plain and numeric-only structures are not supported.'=>'Confirms the permalink structure is compatible with Lingua Forge path routing. Plain and numeric-only structures are not supported.','Lists any active third-party SEO plugins. Lingua Forge adapts its output when these are present — see Settings → SEO → Compatibility for the per-feature breakdown.'=>'Lists any active third-party SEO plugins. Lingua Forge adapts its output when these are present — see Settings → SEO → Compatibility for the per-feature breakdown.','WooCommerce version, order storage mode (CPT / HPOS / shared), and a per-language translation coverage table for the four built-in WC pages (Shop, Cart, Checkout, My Account).'=>'WooCommerce version, order storage mode (CPT / HPOS / shared), and a per-language translation coverage table for the four built-in WC pages (Shop, Cart, Checkout, My Account).','Lists post types that have published posts without a _lf_lang meta value. Posts missing this tag are invisible to all language filters. Use the Repair button to tag them with the source language, or Exclude to remove the post type from language routing entirely.'=>'Lists post types that have published posts without a _lf_lang meta value. Posts missing this tag are invisible to all language filters. Use the Repair button to tag them with the source language, or Exclude to remove the post type from language routing entirely.','Collapsible dump of all LF-owned entries in $wp_rewrite->extra_rules_top. Useful for diagnosing 404s or routing conflicts after adding a new language.'=>'Collapsible dump of all LF-owned entries in $wp_rewrite->extra_rules_top. Useful for diagnosing 404s or routing conflicts after adding a new language.','One-click copy of a plain-text system summary covering all of the above sections. Paste this into a GitHub issue or support request so the full environment is visible at a glance.'=>'One-click copy of a plain-text system summary covering all of the above sections. Paste this into a GitHub issue or support request so the full environment is visible at a glance.','Found a bug or unexpected behaviour? Please open an issue on GitHub — include the Debug Info block above and a short description of what you expected vs. what happened.'=>'Found a bug or unexpected behaviour? Please open an issue on GitHub — include the Debug Info block above and a short description of what you expected vs. what happened.','Open an issue →'=>'Open an issue →','Getting started'=>'Getting started','Server setup (subdomain)'=>'Server setup (subdomain)','Translation workflow'=>'Translation workflow','Language switcher'=>'Language switcher','WP-CLI reference'=>'WP-CLI reference','Integration API'=>'Integration API','Documentation'=>'Documentation','Report an issue on GitHub'=>'Report an issue on GitHub','Anthropic (Claude)'=>'Anthropic (Claude)','OpenAI (GPT)'=>'OpenAI (GPT)','Google (Gemini)'=>'Google (Gemini)','WordPress AI Client (WP 7.0+)'=>'WordPress AI Client (WP 7.0+)','Meta Description, Excerpt Generator'=>'Meta Description, Excerpt Generator','Translation, Content Generator'=>'Translation, Content Generator','Testing…'=>'Testing…','✓ Connection OK'=>'✓ Connection OK','✗ Failed:'=>'✗ Failed:','No response from provider — check the error log for details.'=>'No response from provider — check the error log for details.','Network error — could not reach the WordPress AJAX endpoint.'=>'Network error — could not reach the WordPress AJAX endpoint.','Translating a real post with this model…'=>'Translating a real post with this model…','preset'=>'preset','Loading…'=>'Loading…','Installing…'=>'Installing…','✓ Language installed.'=>'✓ Language installed.','✗ Error:'=>'✗ Error:','Creating…'=>'Creating…','✓ All templates created.'=>'✓ All templates created.','Some templates could not be created.'=>'Some templates could not be created.','Recreating…'=>'Recreating…','✓ All templates recreated.'=>'✓ All templates recreated.','Some templates could not be recreated.'=>'Some templates could not be recreated.','This overwrites this template with a fresh copy from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customisations made to it. This cannot be undone. Continue?'=>'This overwrites this template with a fresh copy from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customizations made to it. This cannot be undone. Continue?','This overwrites every template with a fresh copy from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customisations made to them. This cannot be undone. Continue?'=>'This overwrites every template with a fresh copy from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customizations made to them. This cannot be undone. Continue?','✓ All parts recreated.'=>'✓ All parts recreated.','Some parts could not be recreated.'=>'Some parts could not be recreated.','This overwrites this template part with a fresh copy from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customisations made to it. This cannot be undone. Continue?'=>'This overwrites this template part with a fresh copy from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customizations made to it. This cannot be undone. Continue?','This overwrites every template part with a fresh copy from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customisations made to them. This cannot be undone. Continue?'=>'This overwrites every template part with a fresh copy from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customizations made to them. This cannot be undone. Continue?','✓ All parts created.'=>'✓ All parts created.','Some parts could not be created.'=>'Some parts could not be created.','✓ All translated.'=>'✓ All translated.','Some translations failed.'=>'Some translations failed.','Review carefully — links and slugs not updated.'=>'Review carefully — links and slugs not updated.','Fixing…'=>'Fixing…','✓ Links fixed.'=>'✓ Links fixed.','Some link fixes failed.'=>'Some link fixes failed.','✓ Parts fixed.'=>'✓ Parts fixed.','Some part fixes failed.'=>'Some part fixes failed.','✓ Nav refs fixed.'=>'✓ Nav refs fixed.','Some nav ref fixes failed.'=>'Some nav ref fixes failed.','✓ Pattern translated.'=>'✓ Pattern translated.','Pattern translation failed.'=>'Pattern translation failed.','Hide'=>'Hide','Re-create all templates'=>'Re-create all templates','Re-create all parts'=>'Re-create all parts','This runs Re-create all templates, Re-create all parts, Translate all, Fix all parts, and Fix all links for every one of your {total} active languages, one language at a time. It overwrites existing templates and parts with fresh copies from the active theme (discarding Site Editor customisations) and re-translates content — none of this can be undone. Translate all makes real AI API calls for every template and part, which may take a while and may incur cost depending on your provider. Continue?'=>'This runs Re-create all templates, Re-create all parts, Translate all, Fix all parts, and Fix all links for every one of your {total} active languages, one language at a time. It overwrites existing templates and parts with fresh copies from the active theme (discarding Site Editor customizations) and re-translates content — none of this can be undone. Translate all makes real AI API calls for every template and part, which may take a while and may incur cost depending on your provider. Continue?','This runs Re-create all templates, Translate all, Fix all parts, and Fix all links for every one of your {total} active languages, one language at a time — template parts (headers, footers, etc.) are left untouched. It overwrites existing templates with fresh copies from the active theme (discarding Site Editor customisations) and re-translates content — none of this can be undone. Translate all makes real AI API calls for every template, which may take a while and may incur cost depending on your provider. Continue?'=>'This runs Re-create all templates, Translate all, Fix all parts, and Fix all links for every one of your {total} active languages, one language at a time — template parts (headers, footers, etc.) are left untouched. It overwrites existing templates with fresh copies from the active theme (discarding Site Editor customizations) and re-translates content — none of this can be undone. Translate all makes real AI API calls for every template, which may take a while and may incur cost depending on your provider. Continue?','This runs Re-create all parts (headers, footers, and every other template part) for every one of your {total} active languages, one language at a time. It overwrites existing template parts with fresh copies from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customisations made to them. This cannot be undone. Continue?'=>'This runs Re-create all parts (headers, footers, and every other template part) for every one of your {total} active languages, one language at a time. It overwrites existing template parts with fresh copies from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customizations made to them. This cannot be undone. Continue?','Starting…'=>'Starting…','Processing {lang} ({index} of {total}) — {step}…'=>'Processing {lang} ({index} of {total}) — {step}…','Cancelled.'=>'Cancelled.','{done} of {total} languages processed.'=>'{done} of {total} languages processed.','⚠ Done with issues.'=>'⚠ Done with issues.','✓ All {total} languages processed.'=>'✓ All {total} languages processed.','Built-in preset instructions:'=>'Built-in preset instructions:','No built-in instructions — each AI feature uses its own tuned defaults. Fill in the Custom prompt instructions field below to add your own site-wide rules.'=>'No built-in instructions — each AI feature uses its own tuned defaults. Fill in the Custom prompt instructions field below to add your own site-wide rules.','Modified'=>'Modified','edit'=>'edit','No published posts found for the selected filters.'=>'No published posts found for the selected filters.','Just now'=>'Just now','Score'=>'Score','Source title'=>'Source title','Multilingual SEO overview'=>'Multilingual SEO overview','Scores are a signal, not a verdict. Some content is structurally limited — very short pages, landing pages with little body text, or pages whose purpose is navigation rather than information may score lower by nature. Use this overview to spot genuine parity gaps across languages, not to chase a number.'=>'Scores are a signal, not a verdict. Some content is structurally limited — very short pages, landing pages with little body text, or pages whose purpose is navigation rather than information may score lower by nature. Use this overview to spot genuine parity gaps across languages, not to chase a number.','This is a WooCommerce system page (Shop, Cart, Checkout, etc.). Its content is managed by WooCommerce — the score reflects structural signals only, not user-editable SEO content.'=>'This is a WooCommerce system page (Shop, Cart, Checkout, etc.). Its content is managed by WooCommerce — the score reflects structural signals only, not user-editable SEO content.','Settings'=>'Settings','You do not have permission to manage these settings.'=>'You do not have permission to manage these settings.','Lingua Forge — Settings'=>'Lingua Forge — Settings','Settings saved.'=>'Settings saved.','Save Settings'=>'Save Settings','Standard'=>'Standard','Technical / Scientific'=>'Technical / Scientific','Legal / Compliance'=>'Legal / Compliance','Creative / Marketing'=>'Creative / Marketing','Lingua Forge — AI Usage Statistics'=>'Lingua Forge — AI Usage Statistics','Lingua Forge AI Usage Statistics'=>'Lingua Forge AI Usage Statistics','Date'=>'Date','Request count'=>'Request count','Full Article'=>'Full Article','Introduction only'=>'Introduction only','Structured Outline'=>'Structured Outline','Generate Content'=>'Generate Content','Hints'=>'Hints','Key points, ideas, or structure to build from…'=>'Key points, ideas, or structure to build from…','Tone'=>'Tone','Output'=>'Output','Generate Excerpt'=>'Generate Excerpt','Generate Meta Description'=>'Generate Meta Description','Translate Content'=>'Translate Content','Mode'=>'Mode','Full post'=>'Full post','Translate chunk'=>'Translate chunk','Target Language'=>'Target Language','Text to translate'=>'Text to translate','Paste a footnote, sentence, or any snippet here…'=>'Paste a footnote, sentence, or any snippet here…','Also generate meta description'=>'Also generate meta description','Translated Labels'=>'Translated Labels','Attribute label displayed in this language. Leave empty to use the default label.'=>'Attribute label displayed in this language. Leave empty to use the default label.','Translate all labels (AI)'=>'Translate all labels (AI)','Insufficient permissions.'=>'Insufficient permissions.','All labels already translated.'=>'All labels already translated.','%d label(s) translated.'=>'%d label(s) translated.','Translation failed. Check the browser console.'=>'Translation failed. Check the browser console.','Cannot write to product %1$d: it is a translated version (language: %2$s)%3$s. Operational data (price, stock, SKU, dimensions) must be updated on the source product. Resolve the source product ID via: GET /wp-json/lingua-forge/v1/post/%4$d/translations'=>'Cannot write to product %1$d: it is a translated version (language: %2$s)%3$s. Operational data (price, stock, SKU, dimensions) must be updated on the source product. Resolve the source product ID via: GET /wp-json/lingua-forge/v1/post/%4$d/translations','Translated Names'=>'Translated Names','Name displayed in this language. Leave empty to use the source name.'=>'Name displayed in this language. Leave empty to use the source name.','Translate all tags (AI)'=>'Translate all tags (AI)','Translate all categories (AI)'=>'Translate all categories (AI)','Translate all %s terms (AI)'=>'Translate all %s terms (AI)','Translate all terms (AI)'=>'Translate all terms (AI)','Invalid taxonomy.'=>'Invalid taxonomy.','No terms found.'=>'No terms found.','%d term(s) translated.'=>'%d term(s) translated.','%d already translated — <a href="#" class="lf-force-translate">force retranslate</a>'=>'%d already translated — <a href="#" class="lf-force-translate">force retranslate</a>','%1$d translated, %2$d skipped.'=>'%1$d translated, %2$d skipped.','Order placed in language: %s'=>'Order placed in language: %s','Invalid API key — double-check the key entered in the AI Provider settings.'=>'Invalid API key — double-check the key entered in the AI Provider settings.','Payment required — your account has no remaining credits.'=>'Payment required — your account has no remaining credits.','Access forbidden — your account may be suspended or the key lacks the required permissions.'=>'Access forbidden — your account may be suspended or the key lacks the required permissions.','Rate limited — too many requests sent to the provider; wait a moment and try again.'=>'Rate limited — too many requests sent to the provider; wait a moment and try again.','Provider service temporarily unavailable — try again in a moment.'=>'Provider service temporarily unavailable — try again in a moment.','Provider error (HTTP %1$d): %2$s'=>'Provider error (HTTP %1$d): %2$s','Unexpected provider error (HTTP %d).'=>'Unexpected provider error (HTTP %d).','No API key configured — enter your key in the AI Provider settings.'=>'No API key configured — enter your key in the AI Provider settings.','Network error 